{
	chapter.00011E84ED5EA39A.chapter_subtitle: ["Batteries, gearing, bigger fans and presses, and drilling ore veins out of the ground."]
	chapter.00011E84ED5EA39A.title: "Create: More Machines"
	chapter.006FC04EC31ACFE7.chapter_subtitle: ["Tools built from parts, each part from any material you like, and the Nether and End metals that make the best of them."]
	chapter.006FC04EC31ACFE7.title: "Silent Gear"
	chapter.0464D27111AFF6C4.chapter_subtitle: ["Eight arenas, eight eyes to find them, and the bosses inside."]
	chapter.0464D27111AFF6C4.title: "L_Ender's Cataclysm"
	chapter.06B890659D1F1750.chapter_subtitle: ["From brass casing to the mechanical crafter, crushing wheels and the tools it builds."]
	chapter.06B890659D1F1750.title: "Create: Mechanical Crafting"
	chapter.084B69E7170F741E.chapter_subtitle: ["Find oil, pump it up, split it into fuels in a distillation tower, and burn the diesel in an engine."]
	chapter.084B69E7170F741E.title: "Oil and Engines"
	chapter.0D461919B1C82D38.chapter_subtitle: ["Guns and bullets off the mechanical crafters and the belt."]
	chapter.0D461919B1C82D38.title: "Create Armorer"
	chapter.0FB4652418B4DA84.chapter_subtitle: ["The Factory Must Grow's steelworks: coke ovens, the blast furnace and casting steel by the stack."]
	chapter.0FB4652418B4DA84.title: "Steel and Alloys"
	chapter.136CA92B220A5C4D.chapter_subtitle: ["Spell books with more slots, the essences and inks that go into scrolls, and the forge and anvil that make and improve them."]
	chapter.136CA92B220A5C4D.title: "Iron's Spells: Scrolls and Spellbooks"
	chapter.16948E1D867242E0.chapter_subtitle: ["From andesite alloy through brass to the precision mechanism."]
	chapter.16948E1D867242E0.title: "Create: Andesite to Precision"
	chapter.17A01C422718A63A.chapter_subtitle: ["Through the portal: fortresses, bastions, netherite and the Wither."]
	chapter.17A01C422718A63A.title: "The Nether"
	chapter.183DE125B39604C0.chapter_subtitle: ["Better rods, hooks, bait and lines, fillets from the catch, and neptunium from Neptune's Bounty."]
	chapter.183DE125B39604C0.title: "Aquaculture"
	chapter.1BDCA3F39794A2CF.chapter_subtitle: ["Affix gear, gems and the five world tiers."]
	chapter.1BDCA3F39794A2CF.title: "Apotheosis"
	chapter.1F17920B0F860117.chapter_subtitle: ["Three gun packs, three benches, and the ammo to feed them."]
	chapter.1F17920B0F860117.title: "Guns"
	chapter.20E8D0B024C2412D.chapter_subtitle: ["Eyes of ender to a stronghold, the dragon, and the cities beyond it."]
	chapter.20E8D0B024C2412D.title: "The End"
	chapter.24DBC722ADF457B6.chapter_subtitle: ["From copper pipes to pumps, spouts, tanks and the steam engine."]
	chapter.24DBC722ADF457B6.title: "Create: Fluids and Steam"
	chapter.286B46263DF4DF8F.chapter_subtitle: ["Crafts & Additions: wire, spools and motors, from rotation to power and back."]
	chapter.286B46263DF4DF8F.title: "Create: Electricity"
	chapter.2933A5916F0E7153.chapter_subtitle: ["Four bosses in their own lairs, and the powers they leave behind."]
	chapter.2933A5916F0E7153.title: "Mowzie's Mobs"
	chapter.298422B399CAA56B.chapter_subtitle: ["Farmer's Delight's addons: the Nether, the ocean, Aquaculture's fish, Alex's Mobs and the End, all cooked in the same pot."]
	chapter.298422B399CAA56B.title: "More Delights"
	chapter.2A372F82EF67248E.title: "Getting Started"
	chapter.2A6DBECD42B4A097.chapter_subtitle: ["The catacombs, the Lost Citadel, their bosses, and the Ancient Codex."]
	chapter.2A6DBECD42B4A097.title: "Iron's Spells: Ancient Knowledge"
	chapter.3066A77B8648DDDD.chapter_subtitle: ["From the Moon to Glacio: each planet's metal builds the rocket to the next."]
	chapter.3066A77B8648DDDD.title: "Ad Astra: The Planets"
	chapter.313600851FEF544A.chapter_subtitle: ["Knives and a cutting board, new crops and rich soil, then the stove, the cooking pot and a feast."]
	chapter.313600851FEF544A.title: "Farmer's Delight"
	chapter.3B4294989B442542.chapter_subtitle: ["Farmer's Delight on rotation: the slicer, meals from a heated basin, chocolate and candy, and wine from the cellar."]
	chapter.3B4294989B442542.title: "Create: Kitchen"
	chapter.4412E1B44051BF8F.chapter_subtitle: ["Ancient cities, the Warden, and the Otherside below the bedrock."]
	chapter.4412E1B44051BF8F.title: "The Deep Dark"
	chapter.4657BE0574DA7DA4.chapter_subtitle: ["From the first bearing to pistons, pulleys and machines that move."]
	chapter.4657BE0574DA7DA4.title: "Create: Contraptions"
	chapter.48F05D1F663C727E.chapter_subtitle: ["Apothic Enchanting's shelves: eterna, quanta and arcana, infusion at the table, and the tomes and library that move enchantments around."]
	chapter.48F05D1F663C727E.title: "Enchanting"
	chapter.4A7B7A7FB61DEF2E.chapter_subtitle: ["Experience as a fluid: grind it, store it, and enchant and forge with it by machine."]
	chapter.4A7B7A7FB61DEF2E.title: "Create: Enchantment Industry"
	chapter.4E4B9E708974464B.chapter_subtitle: ["Find the pack's dungeons, temples and ruins, and loot them."]
	chapter.4E4B9E708974464B.title: "Dungeons and Structures"
	chapter.67EBEAD7AC2E98DD.chapter_subtitle: ["From track and train casing to stations, signals and a train that runs itself."]
	chapter.67EBEAD7AC2E98DD.title: "Create: Trains"
	chapter.6C61F52EEAE10A87.chapter_subtitle: ["Generator coils and magnets, energised materials, motors, heat, and a nuclear reactor."]
	chapter.6C61F52EEAE10A87.title: "Create: New Age"
	chapter.6F06BF032B8459D6.chapter_subtitle: ["Cast and bore a cannon, mount it, load it and fire; then shells, quick-firing breeches, built-up steel and nethersteel."]
	chapter.6F06BF032B8459D6.title: "Create: Big Cannons"
	chapter.70FFBEF6E1290061.chapter_subtitle: ["From belts and funnels to packages, frogports and the stock ticker."]
	chapter.70FFBEF6E1290061.title: "Create: Logistics"
	chapter.71ABA115AD07BD0E.chapter_subtitle: ["Waystones, karts, jetpacks and teleporters from the mechanical crafter, and elevators and ships for the walk there."]
	chapter.71ABA115AD07BD0E.title: "Getting Around"
	chapter.767A5A787F1AC863.chapter_subtitle: ["Mana as a fluid: arcane pipes that hold it, a siphon that draws it, and machines that cast spells and catch lightning."]
	chapter.767A5A787F1AC863.title: "Create: Wizardry"
	chapter.77B4AA428D42B348.chapter_subtitle: ["A NASA workbench, a space suit and fuel: everything the first rocket needs to reach the Moon."]
	chapter.77B4AA428D42B348.title: "Ad Astra: Liftoff"
	chapter.77F0A23847420849.chapter_subtitle: ["The ritual brazier, a familiar of your own, starbuncles to carry things, and the spell books for tier two and three glyphs."]
	chapter.77F0A23847420849.title: "Ars Nouveau: Rituals and Familiars"
	chapter.7B1462BC31B82F10.chapter_subtitle: ["A spell book and its first glyphs, then Source: gems, jars, a sourcelink, and the Enchanting Apparatus that crafts with it."]
	chapter.7B1462BC31B82F10.title: "Ars Nouveau: Source"
	chapter.7CBC149B7BF465D5.chapter_subtitle: ["Somewhere to put it all: backpacks with upgrades, chests that grow, and one terminal for every chest in the base."]
	chapter.7CBC149B7BF465D5.title: "Storage"
	chapter.7E2AA7B1C3287E01.chapter_subtitle: ["Advanced hives, bees caught, fed and bred, upgrades, and centrifuges that spin combs into honey, wax and metal."]
	chapter.7E2AA7B1C3287E01.title: "Productive Bees"
	chapter_group.002607DF1C0C507C.title: "Industry"
	chapter_group.01D4CAF8434CE6E3.title: "Food and Farming"
	chapter_group.38141FC7E950B458.title: "Combat and Gear"
	chapter_group.407E89587E4FC002.title: "Space"
	chapter_group.5F1D36673C78B4B6.title: "Magic"
	chapter_group.6571B679503116AE.title: "Storage and Travel"
	chapter_group.6C84DBAA332BC60C.title: "Exploration and Bosses"
	chapter_group.72644D66BC292029.title: "Getting Started"
	chapter_group.7DF81F61BC6148EF.title: "Create"
	quest.00616C116AB4CE73.quest_desc: ["An andesite casing and a chute make a portable storage interface. When a moving contraption stops beside one, it loads and unloads the contraption's chests."]
	quest.00616C116AB4CE73.title: "Portable Storage Interface"
	quest.009D677DBA7F597A.quest_desc: ["Two andesite alloy, a redstone dust and two logs make a cart assembler. Laid in a rail track and powered, it turns a passing minecart and the blocks around it into a contraption on rails."]
	quest.009D677DBA7F597A.title: "Cart Assembler"
	quest.00D287ECAAB91B15.quest_desc: ["Sail frames, lava buckets and a block of cardboard make four. A catalyst sail in front of a fan sets what it processes with, here blasting, without a lava source; other sails make seething, freezing and sanding."]
	quest.00D287ECAAB91B15.title: "Blasting Catalyst Sail"
	quest.00E324586607DBE5.quest_desc: ["Four copper wire on an empty spool. Motors and generators are wound with them, and you use one on two connectors to run wire between them."]
	quest.00E324586607DBE5.title: "Copper Spool"
	quest.00E775D4B05D649E.quest_desc: ["Overcharged iron, gold nuggets, a brass casing and a shaft: a stronger motor. A motor extension behind one raises its stress capacity, and its power draw with it."]
	quest.00E775D4B05D649E.title: "Advanced Motor"
	quest.00ED0347E5F2AE0A.quest_desc: ["Andesite alloy is what most of Create is made of. Andesite and iron or zinc nuggets make it on a crafting table."]
	quest.00ED0347E5F2AE0A.title: "Andesite Alloy"
	quest.014CF98096B18E91.quest_desc: ["Use a copper ingot on a stripped log, by hand or with a deployer, to make copper casing. The fluid machines are built around it."]
	quest.014CF98096B18E91.title: "Copper Casing"
	quest.01582CBDAEFC5996.quest_desc: ["Iron ingots, a cauldron, arcane essence and cinder essence. It brews inks and elixirs: pour a fluid in, add an item, and draw the result out with a bottle."]
	quest.01582CBDAEFC5996.title: "Alchemist Cauldron"
	quest.017A689763157EBC.quest_desc: ["A mixer makes common ink from copper ingots, an ink sac and a little mana, and a bottle draws it from the cauldron or a spout. Scrolls of the commonest spells are written in it."]
	quest.017A689763157EBC.title: "Common Ink"
	quest.01DAD8E551D6BBD8.quest_desc: ["A barrel in eight coal: a pocket inventory of a few slots, each holding far more than a stack. Higher tiers are crafted from the one before, and a dock makes one a block that pipes can reach."]
	quest.01DAD8E551D6BBD8.title: "Dank 1"
	quest.021E838B1362DA17.quest_desc: ["The drilling machine's twin for fluid wells, made with a mechanical pump and a hose pulley in place of the spout and tunnel."]
	quest.021E838B1362DA17.title: "Fluid Well Extractor"
	quest.02272EBBF77AEAC1.quest_desc: ["Four string and an iron ingot: a line for the rod's line slot."]
	quest.02272EBBF77AEAC1.title: "Fishing Line"
	quest.02881C75AB1F9CBD.quest_desc: ["Stalkers drop them, and an ancient temple's fountain chests hold them."]
	quest.02881C75AB1F9CBD.title: "Soul Crystals"
	quest.02B88A8B0E3D70BE.quest_desc: ["Seven glass, an eye of ender and a ghast tear. Four on the edges of the exit portal summon the dragon again."]
	quest.02B88A8B0E3D70BE.title: "End Crystal"
	quest.02C94B54A1954341.quest_desc: ["Smoked ham, cooked rice, sweet berries and a honey bottle, with a bowl. A feast: place it down and serve it to friends a bowl at a time."]
	quest.02C94B54A1954341.title: "Honey Glazed Ham"
	quest.03B25D87AC870099.quest_desc: ["At the NASA workbench: a nose cone, four fins, six desh blocks, two desh tanks and the desh engine. It reaches Mars."]
	quest.03B25D87AC870099.title: "Tier 2 Rocket"
	quest.03EBBAABBCACCC51.quest_desc: ["Terracotta, zinc nuggets and a copper sheet make four. Heat pipes spread heat; a block that gets too hot turns to lava."]
	quest.03EBBAABBCACCC51.title: "Heat Pipe"
	quest.04197D14DDEDA5C1.quest_desc: ["A shaft, a propeller, cogwheels and a cast iron pipe. Turned, it draws in air for the blast stove."]
	quest.04197D14DDEDA5C1.title: "Air Intake"
	quest.05AD25FDBCCCB8A1.quest_desc: ["The nose cone, six blocks of steel, four fins, two steel tanks and the engine, put together in the NASA workbench. Fuel it, set it on the launch pad, put on the suit and go to the Moon."]
	quest.05AD25FDBCCCB8A1.title: "Tier 1 Rocket"
	quest.05BEEE7D3FB209D5.quest_desc: ["At a smithing table, the template and an ingot turn a diamond pickaxe into netherite, enchantments and all. The same works on any diamond tool or armour piece."]
	quest.05BEEE7D3FB209D5.title: "Netherite Gear"
	quest.05C5C1EBFC129506.quest_desc: ["Silent Gear starts on a stone anvil. Hit a log on it with the crude knife and it cuts into six template boards; the knife and anvil are cobblestone, dirt and sticks."]
	quest.05C5C1EBFC129506.title: "Template Boards"
	quest.05CEA6A594FB5030.quest_desc: ["A block of lapis and an arcane ingot, which is an ingot crafted with eight arcane essence. Casing for the machines that handle mana."]
	quest.05CEA6A594FB5030.title: "Arcane Casing"
	quest.06155381A5859B00.quest_desc: ["An armored knight waiting in a Wrought Chamber underground; the Explorer's Compass finds one. Dodge its axe, then strike while it's stuck."]
	quest.06155381A5859B00.title: "The Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.061574C47752DC99.quest_desc: ["A gold ingot and four blaze powder at a crafting table. The alloy forge makes it with half the powder."]
	quest.061574C47752DC99.title: "Blaze Gold"
	quest.06C2565AE6241A65.quest_desc: ["A nether star, three obsidian and five glass. On a pyramid of iron, gold, emerald, diamond or netherite blocks it gives speed, haste or strength to everyone nearby."]
	quest.06C2565AE6241A65.title: "Beacon"
	quest.06C4D3858B6FE6B7.quest_desc: ["A copper rod, andesite alloy and a slimeball make three. Place one on each machine and join them with a spool to carry power."]
	quest.06C4D3858B6FE6B7.title: "Small Connector"
	quest.073E1DB35CD58FAA.quest_desc: ["Open 25 Lootr containers."]
	quest.073E1DB35CD58FAA.title: "Close Quarters"
	quest.075DE9AB03FE7CD7.quest_desc: ["Sugar and cinder flour, crushed from netherrack, mix into gingerdough; bake it in a furnace."]
	quest.075DE9AB03FE7CD7.title: "Gingerbread"
	quest.07EAB6E6813B93C7.quest_desc: ["Smelted from the raw ostrum mined on Mars."]
	quest.07EAB6E6813B93C7.title: "Ostrum Ingot"
	quest.08292884343A2A80.quest_desc: ["Deeper Darker has the Warden drop its heart, along with a few warden carapaces. Keep it: it opens the way to the Otherside."]
	quest.08292884343A2A80.title: "Heart of the Deep"
	quest.0857BF09DA8F8A5B.quest_desc: ["Andesite alloy, coal and a shaft. Brushes on the coil collect the electricity it makes."]
	quest.0857BF09DA8F8A5B.title: "Carbon Brushes"
	quest.08AA13C3BDA31881.quest_desc: ["Eight planks of any one wood and a lever: a chest that takes upgrades. A basic tier upgrade turns a vanilla chest or barrel into one where it stands."]
	quest.08AA13C3BDA31881.title: "Sophisticated Chest"
	quest.08AE9F39D7ADB0A5.quest_desc: ["A book and a lapis lazuli. It's Ars Nouveau's guide: every block, glyph and ritual in this group has a page in it."]
	quest.08AE9F39D7ADB0A5.title: "Tattered Tome"
	quest.08C8941F95FDEB74.quest_desc: ["A bucket's worth of common ink and a copper ingot brew uncommon ink in the cauldron. Each rarer ink brews the same way from the one below it: iron for rare, gold for epic, an amethyst shard for legendary."]
	quest.08C8941F95FDEB74.title: "Uncommon Ink"
	quest.08E38215D89F6B6B.quest_desc: ["Heavy plates, iron rods, redstone torches, a crafting table and a block of steel. Every rocket is crafted in it."]
	quest.08E38215D89F6B6B.title: "NASA Workbench"
	quest.092518A48FED1029.quest_desc: ["Mix four sugar cane, or other plant matter, with water in a basin to make pulp, and press the pulp into cardboard. Four cardboard make a block of cardboard."]
	quest.092518A48FED1029.title: "Cardboard"
	quest.096EBCCD33ED0070.quest_desc: ["The Harbinger drops a Block of Witherite; craft it into ingots."]
	quest.096EBCCD33ED0070.title: "Witherite Ingot"
	quest.097147F0F717DEC3.quest_desc: ["The apparatus (gold, sourcestone and a diamond) sits on an Arcane Core. Fill the pedestals around it, use the middle item on the apparatus, and it crafts with Source from the jars nearby: charms, rings, the dominion wand and more."]
	quest.097147F0F717DEC3.title: "Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.0990FE1228ECB728.quest_desc: ["Three iron, four bricks and a campfire. It cooks food on top like a campfire, and heats a cooking pot or skillet set on it."]
	quest.0990FE1228ECB728.title: "Stove"
	quest.09948ED1E8B7DE79.quest_desc: ["Sourcestone, a Source Gem and gold nuggets. Pedestals hold a recipe's items around the Enchanting Apparatus, within three blocks, or beside the Imbuement Chamber."]
	quest.09948ED1E8B7DE79.title: "Arcane Pedestals"
	quest.09C0A68BBCD14E2A.quest_desc: ["Bind a Starbuncle, Drygmy, Whirlisprig, Wixie, Bookwyrm or Amethyst Golem, then use its script to summon it as a familiar. Each grants something: a Starbuncle Speed, a Bookwyrm picking up items, a Drygmy more Earth damage and looting."]
	quest.09C0A68BBCD14E2A.title: "A Familiar"
	quest.0A23B2C48428080A.quest_desc: ["Use an empty blaze burner on a blaze, in a Nether fortress, to catch it. Brass is mixed heated, and a heated mix needs a blaze burner fed with fuel."]
	quest.0A23B2C48428080A.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.0A96D88D7CF4B814.quest_desc: ["Breaks gear you no longer need back down into its parts and materials. A piston and four crimson iron."]
	quest.0A96D88D7CF4B814.title: "Salvager"
	quest.0B00D0E4281C9027.quest_desc: ["Chorus plants grow on the outer islands. Eating the fruit teleports you a short way; popped in a furnace it makes purpur."]
	quest.0B00D0E4281C9027.title: "Chorus Fruit"
	quest.0B0102F4B04D8008.quest_desc: ["Mages, cultists and other spellcasters drop it, and it turns up in their chests. A spout also makes it from redstone and Create: Wizardry's mana."]
	quest.0B0102F4B04D8008.title: "Arcane Essence"
	quest.0B9F1E3F0E125A52.quest_desc: ["String, iron and leather. Every backpack upgrade starts from one, and they go in the backpack's upgrade slots."]
	quest.0B9F1E3F0E125A52.title: "Upgrade Base"
	quest.0BE5752A6DDD6DB9.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from four copper spools, iron sheets, an iron rod and andesite alloy. It turns rotation into power."]
	quest.0BE5752A6DDD6DB9.title: "Alternator"
	quest.0BFEE4151EC8C9CB.quest_desc: ["Nether quartz and eight redstone dust make rose quartz on a crafting table. Polish it with sand paper, which is paper and sand."]
	quest.0BFEE4151EC8C9CB.title: "Polished Rose Quartz"
	quest.0C179C226BE4F22E.quest_desc: ["Sequenced assembly on a heavy plate, two loops: steel cogwheels, nickel sheets, large steel cogwheels, lead sheets, then screws driven in with a screwdriver. It is to TFMG what the precision mechanism is to Create."]
	quest.0C179C226BE4F22E.title: "Steel Mechanism"
	quest.0C67DB7326145622.quest_desc: ["End stone bricks, a bookshelf, an ender pearl and Infused Dragon's Breath, which is dragon's breath infused at 80 eterna and 60 arcana."]
	quest.0C67DB7326145622.title: "Endshelf"
	quest.0CA69E767799BC5A.quest_desc: ["A Tome of Superior Scrapping infused at the table makes four. It takes all of an item's enchantments and leaves the item whole."]
	quest.0CA69E767799BC5A.title: "Tome of Extraction"
	quest.0CBB8076D40781EC.quest_desc: ["The mechanical press makes golden sheets from gold ingots."]
	quest.0CBB8076D40781EC.title: "Golden Sheet"
	quest.0CC078D0990561FF.quest_desc: ["LaserIO moves items, fluids and energy between blocks by laser: put a node beside each block and link the nodes with the laser wrench."]
	quest.0CC078D0990561FF.title: "Laser Node"
	quest.0D43965368217D48.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from brass blocks and sheets, a copper and a brass casing, electron tubes, precision mechanisms, a spout, a mechanical drill, a brass tunnel and sturdy sheets. Place it over a vein, put a drill in and give it rotation, and it brings up the vein's ore; some veins also need drilling fluid."]
	quest.0D43965368217D48.title: "Drilling Machine"
	quest.0D4B096E0D561E37.quest_desc: ["An amethyst shard or a lapis lazuli in the Imbuement Chamber becomes a Source Gem, the material nearly everything else here is made from."]
	quest.0D4B096E0D561E37.title: "Source Gems"
	quest.0D771262CD70BB56.quest_desc: ["Wear a full set of epic gear and kill the Ender Dragon. The top tier, with the strongest mobs and the best loot."]
	quest.0D771262CD70BB56.title: "World Tier: Pinnacle"
	quest.0D8DEB4793B0CD2D.quest_desc: ["Amethyst, emeralds and ender pearls in a mechanical crafter. Use it to teleport to any waystone you've activated; every waystone is built around one."]
	quest.0D8DEB4793B0CD2D.title: "Warp Stone"
	quest.0DB3CEDF139BC729.quest_desc: ["A double hook can catch two things at once, a redstone hook gives you longer to reel a fish in, and a note hook plays an alert when a fish approaches. Light and heavy hooks cast further or shorter."]
	quest.0DB3CEDF139BC729.title: "Special Hooks"
	quest.0DD19F9CDE23C62E.quest_desc: ["Two andesite alloy and three logs make three linear chassis, or three radial chassis. A chassis carries the blocks beside it, in a line or a ring, when the contraption it belongs to moves."]
	quest.0DD19F9CDE23C62E.title: "Chassis"
	quest.0E159A03043B17B5.quest_desc: ["Strong all round and fire-resistant. The first ones are crafted, one at a time, from four crimson iron, two blaze rods and a magma cream; the alloy forge needs four."]
	quest.0E159A03043B17B5.title: "Crimson Steel"
	quest.0E5AE61E136758A1.quest_desc: ["Five paper, two ancient knowledge fragments and two cinder essence. Unfurl it to find the Lost Citadel."]
	quest.0E5AE61E136758A1.title: "Ancient Furled Map"
	quest.0F0B646A315F54D1.quest_desc: ["A train casing and a wooden pressure plate make two train observers. On a track, one gives a redstone signal while a train passes over it."]
	quest.0F0B646A315F54D1.title: "Train Observer"
	quest.0F0D4205866FF14D.quest_desc: ["Three nether bricks, four polished blackstone bricks and a campfire: a stove from the Nether's stone. Made with a soul campfire, it's the soul version."]
	quest.0F0D4205866FF14D.title: "Nether Stove"
	quest.0F0F05F18F1352C3.quest_desc: ["Three andesite alloy, an iron ingot and an andesite casing make a mechanical drill. It breaks the blocks in front of it, standing still or riding on a contraption."]
	quest.0F0F05F18F1352C3.title: "Mechanical Drill"
	quest.0F78D7404B6233D8.quest_desc: ["An arcane pipe and a cogwheel: a mechanical pump for mana."]
	quest.0F78D7404B6233D8.title: "Arcane Pump"
	quest.0FF1E3CE4D334402.quest_desc: ["Create: Deep Dark's sequenced assembly, five times over: fill a netherite ingot with lava, press it, fill it with molten echo, deploy blaze powder and press again. Molten echo is echo shards in a superheated mixer."]
	quest.0FF1E3CE4D334402.title: "Echo Ingot"
	quest.100BE2A9D372440A.quest_desc: ["A nose cone, four fins, six calorite blocks, two calorite tanks and the calorite engine. It's the rocket that leaves the solar system."]
	quest.100BE2A9D372440A.title: "Tier 4 Rocket"
	quest.10C6F926AD096040.quest_desc: ["Five ostrum plates around a desh tank and a steel rod. The rocket takes two."]
	quest.10C6F926AD096040.title: "Ostrum Tank"
	quest.11035283280C5B16.quest_desc: ["A diesel engine with brass sheets and andesite alloy. They stack, and give more stress capacity the more you stack."]
	quest.11035283280C5B16.title: "Modular Diesel Engine"
	quest.1106E88FD7324D53.quest_desc: ["Umvuthi's mask. Wear it to call down the sun's power on your enemies."]
	quest.1106E88FD7324D53.title: "Sol Visage"
	quest.112EAAE8696F55A8.quest_desc: ["Atlantic halibut, an egg and an onion in the cooking pot. A neptunium knife, from Aquaculture's best metal, cuts more fillets from each fish."]
	quest.112EAAE8696F55A8.title: "Halibut with Tartar Sauce"
	quest.11A8AD497C02A95E.quest_desc: ["A mechanical saw cuts one brass sheet into 32. Each round has its own casing, cut the same way: rimmed blunt AP, SLAP, 40mm HE, grenade and 12 gauge."]
	quest.11A8AD497C02A95E.title: "Pneumatic Pistol Casings"
	quest.122511CBDDC7CE41.quest_desc: ["Break the end crystals on the obsidian pillars first, or they heal it. YUNG's Better End Island gives the island a new spawn platform, a central tower and new gateways, and a bell tolls before the dragon is summoned."]
	quest.122511CBDDC7CE41.title: "The Ender Dragon"
	quest.12A824E9981DF29F.quest_desc: ["Smelt the debris into netherite scrap, then craft four scrap with four gold ingots. Netherite gear outlasts diamond and won't burn in lava."]
	quest.12A824E9981DF29F.title: "Netherite Ingot"
	quest.12CED059BBDD425E.quest_desc: ["A basic energiser with overcharged gold and lightning rods. It energises faster."]
	quest.12CED059BBDD425E.title: "Advanced Energiser"
	quest.13601A7E258F0591.quest_desc: ["Crushing wheels grind coal coke into dust, which is what the blast furnace burns."]
	quest.13601A7E258F0591.title: "Coal Coke Dust"
	quest.139623F0052D535E.quest_desc: ["A copper casing and dried kelp make a spout. Fed by a pipe, it fills the item below it on a depot or a belt: a bucket, a bottle, or anything a recipe fills with fluid."]
	quest.139623F0052D535E.title: "Spout"
	quest.13D33346F36B1390.quest_desc: ["Every gun in the default pack and Fallout's is made here, from iron, logs and a block of iron. Guns also turn up in structure chests, but making one is the way to complete a quest."]
	quest.13D33346F36B1390.title: "TaCZ Gun Smith Table"
	quest.13DC25BF054B85E8.quest_desc: ["A lever, a train casing and a precision mechanism make train controls. A train needs one to be driven: build it on bogeys at a station, glue it together, and assemble it from the station."]
	quest.13DC25BF054B85E8.title: "Train Controls"
	quest.142EA203BB462043.quest_desc: ["Two diamonds, two string and a stick: the strongest rod you can craft."]
	quest.142EA203BB462043.title: "Diamond Fishing Rod"
	quest.156A89680C56B312.quest_desc: ["Use a quick-firing mechanism on a sliding breech to convert it. Open it from the side, load the projectile, then a big cartridge (a sheet pressed in five loops, then filled), and close it; spent cases eject themselves."]
	quest.156A89680C56B312.title: "Quick-Firing Breech"
	quest.163798828170E009.quest_desc: ["Andesite alloy, shaftless cogwheels and a large coaxial cogwheel. It turns at the average of its two input shafts, so with a small cogwheel on it, it adds two speeds together."]
	quest.163798828170E009.title: "Differential"
	quest.16AEC19A7BE57AA2.quest_desc: ["A blaze rod on three cobblestone, fuelled with blaze powder. Nether wart in a bottle of water makes the awkward potion most others start from."]
	quest.16AEC19A7BE57AA2.title: "Brewing Stand"
	quest.16DF58934349AC94.quest_desc: ["Turns water into oxygen and fills space suits and gas tanks with it. It runs on power, like the refinery."]
	quest.16DF58934349AC94.title: "Oxygen Loader"
	quest.17025CEF04B29ED2.quest_desc: ["Sand, dirt and clay. A cannon mould, sawn from a log with a mechanical saw, is built into a cast layer of casting sand; fill the cast with molten metal, let it set, then break it open."]
	quest.17025CEF04B29ED2.title: "Casting Sand"
	quest.1720D9E45E902D58.quest_desc: ["The Umvuthana live in groves in the savanna, around their leader. Wear one of their masks and they'll take you for one of their own."]
	quest.1720D9E45E902D58.title: "Birds of a Feather"
	quest.1753C678A121947A.quest_desc: ["Uses gem dust and rarity materials to raise a gem's purity. Socket a gem into gear at a smithing table, item on the left and gem on the right; taking it out again is costly."]
	quest.1753C678A121947A.title: "Gem Cutting Table"
	quest.175B536816261262.quest_desc: [
		"A book, diamonds and obsidian. The shelves around it set its Eterna (the highest level it can enchant at), Quanta (how random the result is) and Arcana (rarer enchantments, and more of them)."
		""
		"The table also infuses: an item enchanted at the right eterna, quanta and arcana becomes something else."
	]
	quest.175B536816261262.title: "Enchanting Table"
	quest.175FF672D51D6D18.quest_desc: ["Steel fluid tanks with the controller beside them and up to six outputs stacked above, with industrial pipe between, and a heat source under the tanks. Pump crude oil into the controller and it splits into heavy oil, diesel, kerosene, naphtha, gasoline and LPG."]
	quest.175FF672D51D6D18.title: "Distillation Tower"
	quest.178AF8F67536B6AC.quest_desc: ["Four cast iron ingots and a block of industrial iron make two; cast iron is an iron ingot and coal pressed in a heated basin. Coke ovens are slow, so build them in long rows."]
	quest.178AF8F67536B6AC.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.17C1B624BF095E81.quest_desc: ["A wooden slab, a stone and a shaft make a windmill bearing, and wool, two sticks and an andesite alloy make two windmill sails. Attach at least eight sails to the bearing and it turns on its own, with no water in sight."]
	quest.17C1B624BF095E81.title: "Windmill"
	quest.17C900D41ADE92FD.quest_desc: ["Four soul sand in a T with three wither skeleton skulls on top; the last skull summons it. Fight it far from home: it explodes as it spawns, breaks blocks as it flies, and below half health arrows glance off it."]
	quest.17C900D41ADE92FD.title: "The Wither"
	quest.17CF01F83F8271AF.quest_desc: ["Wither skeletons walk the fortress and now and then drop their skull; a Looting sword helps. Three make the Wither's head."]
	quest.17CF01F83F8271AF.title: "Wither Skeleton Skulls"
	quest.17DED963B0D225CF.quest_desc: ["464 degrees at the surface: land in the netherite space suit. Calorite ore is found only here."]
	quest.17DED963B0D225CF.title: "Venus"
	quest.18BAC74E365D3EF6.quest_desc: ["Crushing wheels turn iron ore into crushed raw iron, often with extra, and raw iron into one each. Smelt it, or wash it for more."]
	quest.18BAC74E365D3EF6.title: "Crushed Iron"
	quest.18CA23C9694BB7C3.quest_desc: ["A brass casing, an electron tube and a crafting table make three mechanical crafters. Set them side by side in a grid, facing the same way, to craft recipes too big for a crafting table; a crushing wheel takes twenty-one of them."]
	quest.18CA23C9694BB7C3.title: "Mechanical Crafters"
	quest.18CE888BCDB625CF.quest_desc: ["Cannon blocks placed one by one don't connect. Use the welder on two that line up and match in material and type to join them, though a weld can weaken some cannons."]
	quest.18CE888BCDB625CF.title: "Cannon Welder"
	quest.194BF4B833718940.quest_desc: ["The chassis and motor come from a mechanical crafter, the motor with a steam engine and pieces of train casing in it; each wheel is a cogwheel and a belt."]
	quest.194BF4B833718940.title: "Kart Parts"
	quest.1958706F267D3E8E.quest_desc: ["A centrifuge and redstone: it runs on power, faster. The heated centrifuge after it, which takes an inactive dragon egg, is too hot for wax."]
	quest.1958706F267D3E8E.title: "Powered Centrifuge"
	quest.195874A714B642A9.quest_desc: ["Crushing mined thorium gives radioactive thorium one time in ten; pressed onto an iron sheet in sequenced assembly, it becomes fuel."]
	quest.195874A714B642A9.title: "Nuclear Fuel"
	quest.196C9514BEC4708C.quest_desc: ["Summon Ignis at the Burning Arena's Altar of Fire, and put it out."]
	quest.196C9514BEC4708C.title: "Ignis"
	quest.19A08F6D0AEA692F.quest_desc: ["A book and an iron shovel, pickaxe, axe and sword. It casts spells built from glyphs, and a novice book reaches the first tier of them."]
	quest.19A08F6D0AEA692F.title: "Novice Spell Book"
	quest.19B3FA80432C8F74.quest_desc: ["Five ostrum plates, a fan and the desh engine."]
	quest.19B3FA80432C8F74.title: "Ostrum Engine"
	quest.19C3982E2288C1BB.quest_desc: ["Five desh plates around a steel tank and a steel rod. The rocket takes two."]
	quest.19C3982E2288C1BB.title: "Desh Tank"
	quest.1A0A422F73E1F49E.quest_desc: ["A train casing and an electron tube make four train signals. Signals split a track into sections so trains sharing it don't run into each other."]
	quest.1A0A422F73E1F49E.title: "Train Signal"
	quest.1A0F1DB5E49CB351.quest_desc: ["Opens a terminal from a distance. The advanced wireless terminal reaches further."]
	quest.1A0F1DB5E49CB351.title: "Wireless Terminal"
	quest.1A1B01133C6E0D63.quest_desc: ["A knife of end stone, the first of End's Delight's knives; purpur and dragon tooth ones come later."]
	quest.1A1B01133C6E0D63.title: "End Stone Knife"
	quest.1A39575D180D1E5E.quest_desc: ["Press apples into apple must, in a basin or by hand, and mature it in the wine cellar."]
	quest.1A39575D180D1E5E.title: "Cider"
	quest.1ADA3CAD19577BDE.quest_desc: ["Desh ore is found only on the Moon; smelt the raw desh into ingots. A Tier 2 Rocket alone takes six blocks of it."]
	quest.1ADA3CAD19577BDE.title: "Desh Ingot"
	quest.1B0FF5899D1C50F4.quest_desc: ["Helmet, suit, pants and boots, mostly heavy plates and wool; the suit holds two gas tanks and oxygen gear. Wear all four to breathe and survive the cold outside the Overworld."]
	quest.1B0FF5899D1C50F4.title: "Space Suit"
	quest.1B3437B64F242678.quest_desc: ["Four cobwebs, four cracked stone bricks and a compass. Right-click it to pick a structure from every mod in the pack, and it points at the nearest one."]
	quest.1B3437B64F242678.title: "Explorer's Compass"
	quest.1B51D5E70031131E.quest_desc: ["Connects every inventory touching it into one network, Tom's Simple Storage's start. Cable reaches inventories further away, attached with inventory cable connectors."]
	quest.1B51D5E70031131E.title: "Inventory Connector"
	quest.1B96D49C911CE19A.quest_desc: ["A pump shotgun from the gun smith table: 25 iron and 12 logs."]
	quest.1B96D49C911CE19A.title: "M870"
	quest.1BD3448C6EBB129A.quest_desc: ["Dirt, straw, rotten flesh and bone meal, or tree bark in place of the flesh. Placed down, it composts better with sun, water and mushrooms nearby."]
	quest.1BD3448C6EBB129A.title: "Organic Compost"
	quest.1C148461904D16AC.quest_desc: ["The Shattered of the Deeplands and Echoing Forest drop them, and temple chests hold them."]
	quest.1C148461904D16AC.title: "Sculk Bones"
	quest.1C5662B38E0DB19D.quest_desc: ["An endshelf with end rods and ender pearls."]
	quest.1C5662B38E0DB19D.title: "Pearlescent Endshelf"
	quest.1C7DC843DD6EE7A0.quest_desc: ["Two heavy plates and a barrel make two. The pumpjack and the distillation tower are both built on them."]
	quest.1C7DC843DD6EE7A0.title: "Steel Fluid Tank"
	quest.1C800E1A530AED38.quest_desc: ["Press cocoa beans into crushed cocoa, then run it through crushing wheels for cocoa powder and cocoa butter."]
	quest.1C800E1A530AED38.title: "Cocoa Powder"
	quest.1D4BDA113AC5A145.quest_desc: ["A glass, a stock link and a gold ingot make a stock ticker. It shows everything in its network and takes orders: pick what you want and the packagers send it to you."]
	quest.1D4BDA113AC5A145.title: "Stock Ticker"
	quest.1D6A03F44C45D8EE.quest_desc: ["A stone button and redstone make four. A fuze on a shell's head sets it off; deployers can fit them."]
	quest.1D6A03F44C45D8EE.title: "Impact Fuze"
	quest.1D9C70F074C8E416.quest_desc: ["Eight stone around a Source Gem makes eight. The pedestals, the core and the apparatus are built from it."]
	quest.1D9C70F074C8E416.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.1DB6886BCDD1ABF3.quest_desc: ["Place it on an inventory in the network and every item in it is at hand: search, take and put back from one screen."]
	quest.1DB6886BCDD1ABF3.title: "Storage Terminal"
	quest.1DB6C6F5F33038E7.quest_desc: ["A hellshelf infused at a table with at least 45 eterna and 30 quanta. Infused shelves give more, and Blazing and Glowing Hellshelves are crafted from them."]
	quest.1DB6C6F5F33038E7.title: "Infused Hellshelf"
	quest.1DEBFB469A7B8AB6.quest_desc: ["The Storm Empress, in the Acropolis."]
	quest.1DEBFB469A7B8AB6.title: "Scylla"
	quest.1E12D7A55B984B9C.quest_desc: ["Fireproof bricks, cast iron pipes and a block of cast iron. It's the base of the blast furnace: build a cylinder of fireproof bricks around it and feed iron, flux and fuel in through the hole at the top."]
	quest.1E12D7A55B984B9C.title: "Blast Furnace Output"
	quest.1E92E5A75E5CC566.quest_desc: ["Dried kelp, a precision mechanism, a propeller, iron sheets and a cogwheel make eight. Join two ends with more tube and turn either end, and it moves a stack at a time between inventories, filtered at the input."]
	quest.1E92E5A75E5CC566.title: "Pneumatic Tube"
	quest.1E9CB2E621A1E820.quest_desc: ["An arcane pedestal, a block of source gems and gold ingots. Use a ritual tablet on it to start that ritual, which draws Source from jars nearby; a redstone signal stops it."]
	quest.1E9CB2E621A1E820.title: "Ritual Brazier"
	quest.1EBFD1B83AE45DAA.quest_desc: ["Rice in the cooking pot, with a bowl to serve it."]
	quest.1EBFD1B83AE45DAA.title: "Cooked Rice"
	quest.1ECAD497C0AD8335.quest_desc: ["Four planks of any wood make a crafting table."]
	quest.1ECAD497C0AD8335.title: "A Crafting Table"
	quest.1EEC175F0767E0D0.quest_desc: ["Place the cannon on a mount and power its hammer face with redstone to assemble it. Rotation into the mount aims it up, down and side to side; power the lit face to fire."]
	quest.1EEC175F0767E0D0.title: "Cannon Mount"
	quest.1F58FC1B46D691D5.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from iron ingots, packed guncotton and a wooden slab. Fit a fuze, or it lands like solid shot."]
	quest.1F58FC1B46D691D5.title: "High Explosive Shell"
	quest.1FA6531E9812A75F.quest_desc: ["A book, wooden slabs and fences. It writes the spell on a scroll into a spell book, as long as the scroll isn't too rare for the book."]
	quest.1FA6531E9812A75F.title: "Inscription Table"
	quest.1FD34643773C8684.quest_desc: ["A brass casing, two capacitors, a copper rod and electrum wire. It stores power, and accumulators placed together join into one bigger store."]
	quest.1FD34643773C8684.title: "Accumulator"
	quest.1FF68F8097C7D658.quest_desc: ["A stock link and a precision mechanism make two factory gauges. A gauge keeps a target amount of one item in stock, ordering the ingredients from the network and sending them to the machines that make it."]
	quest.1FF68F8097C7D658.title: "Factory Gauge"
	quest.2000BB1C480F77C9.quest_desc: ["Cast iron pipes and tanks and fireproof bricks make two. It heats air with a little gas fuel, such as the furnace's own furnace gas, and the hot air goes into the hatch in the furnace's wall."]
	quest.2000BB1C480F77C9.title: "Blast Stove"
	quest.20BB7C3765A01A32.quest_desc: ["Kill a pig or hoglin with a knife for ham, then cook it in a smoker."]
	quest.20BB7C3765A01A32.title: "Smoked Ham"
	quest.20C5F21C2FC0D60F.quest_desc: ["Brush the suspicious sand inside the Cursed Pyramid to wake it, then knock it down."]
	quest.20C5F21C2FC0D60F.title: "The Ancient Remnant"
	quest.20DB94C11C7DF100.quest_desc: ["Prismarine, diamonds, a lightning rod and a water bucket around an eye of ender. It leads to the Acropolis, in the sky over a warm ocean."]
	quest.20DB94C11C7DF100.title: "Eye of Storm"
	quest.20F951B43742FDBD.quest_desc: ["Rare ore buried low in the Nether, most of it around y 15. It survives explosions, so beds and TNT uncover it; mine it with a diamond pickaxe."]
	quest.20F951B43742FDBD.title: "Ancient Debris"
	quest.21190C0C2AEF7EAB.quest_desc: ["Use a brass ingot on a stripped log, by hand or with a deployer, to make brass casing. Mechanical crafters take one each, so make a few."]
	quest.21190C0C2AEF7EAB.title: "Brass Casing"
	quest.215A3AF9A52B9BA0.quest_desc: ["Iron bars on a copper casing make an item drain. Items that pass over it are emptied of their fluid: a bucket of lava, a bottle of honey."]
	quest.215A3AF9A52B9BA0.title: "Item Drain"
	quest.218A96191183E169.quest_desc: ["Four cogwheels around a large coaxial cogwheel. It meshes like a large cogwheel, but its shaft turns twice as fast and the other way."]
	quest.218A96191183E169.title: "Planetary Gearset"
	quest.21CD3E4503D10EAC.quest_desc: ["Use it on a placed chest or barrel to make it the copper tier, with more slots and nothing taken out. Iron, gold, diamond and netherite upgrades follow."]
	quest.21CD3E4503D10EAC.title: "Copper Tier Upgrade"
	quest.21D9DE08DAB39D42.quest_desc: ["Blocks of amethyst, a diamond, polished deepslate and an anvil. It combines two scrolls of a spell into a stronger one, and puts upgrade orbs and spells onto gear."]
	quest.21D9DE08DAB39D42.title: "Arcane Anvil"
	quest.21F6889484056B47.quest_desc: ["A blast furnace needs reinforcements to run, and they're made of steel. Mix two iron ingots and coal in a heated basin for two steel ingots; Create Ironworks' superheated mix of iron and coal dust works too."]
	quest.21F6889484056B47.title: "First Steel"
	quest.2213A6927D9613C8.quest_desc: ["Fuel the Tier 1 Rocket on its launch pad, fill the space suit with oxygen and launch, then pick the Moon on the planets screen and hold jump to slow the lander. There's no air and it's 173 degrees below zero, so keep the suit on."]
	quest.2213A6927D9613C8.title: "The Moon"
	quest.221C682830211660.quest_desc: ["An iron sheet and a fluid pipe make a fluid valve. Turn it one way and it opens, the other way and it shuts its pipe."]
	quest.221C682830211660.title: "Fluid Valve"
	quest.222B4290C9042473.quest_desc: ["Raw beef, a carrot and a potato in the cooking pot. Meals like it grant Nourishment, which keeps the food meter from dropping."]
	quest.222B4290C9042473.title: "Beef Stew"
	quest.224542C9A4AA68DF.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses rebuilds every fortress in nether brick, with blaze spawners, wither skeletons and chests; the vanilla fortress is turned off in this pack. It's what the next few quests need."]
	quest.224542C9A4AA68DF.title: "A Fortress"
	quest.2247B1FE82C858BD.quest_desc: ["Iron sheets, shafts, andesite alloy and an andesite casing. Given rotation, it rolls ingots into rods and sheets into wire."]
	quest.2247B1FE82C858BD.title: "Rolling Mill"
	quest.22A13C9DAA4D9BA3.quest_desc: ["Works like a blaze burner under a boiler, but burns heat instead of fuel: the more heat it gets, the more it gives."]
	quest.22A13C9DAA4D9BA3.title: "Boiler Heater"
	quest.234A1BB0FEA33BEC.quest_desc: ["Iron sheets around an iron rod. Steel tanks, the space suit and the oxygen loader are all built around them."]
	quest.234A1BB0FEA33BEC.title: "Gas Tank"
	quest.23501177234F51FB.quest_desc: ["A transmitter and an item vault make a stock link. On a packager, it joins that packager's inventory to a logistics network every other stock link on the same frequency can see."]
	quest.23501177234F51FB.title: "Stock Link"
	quest.238A7711169CFF45.quest_desc: ["A ruined piglin stronghold of blackstone, guarded by piglins and piglin brutes. Wear a piece of gold armour and the piglins leave you be; the brutes don't."]
	quest.238A7711169CFF45.title: "A Bastion"
	quest.23A5D015142D7255.quest_desc: ["A pickaxe head and a tool rod at a crafting table, any material for either. Other gear works the same way: a blueprint, the parts, then the parts together."]
	quest.23A5D015142D7255.title: "Pickaxe"
	quest.23FFF794E1131A4D.quest_desc: ["Chests that share their contents across any distance, linked by their colors, and made private or team-only with the right item. An ender pouch, leather and an eye of ender, goes into the recipe; a linked ender bag opens the chest from your inventory."]
	quest.23FFF794E1131A4D.title: "Ender Chest"
	quest.243789BED85BE7B2.quest_desc: ["A precision mechanism in a brass casing makes a rotation speed controller. It sets the speed of the cogwheel above it, whatever is turning it."]
	quest.243789BED85BE7B2.title: "Rotation Speed Controller"
	quest.24974C509DC442F4.quest_desc: ["Projectile (a fletching table and an arrow) and Touch (a button) say how a spell is cast; Break (an iron pickaxe) is what it does. Throw the codex's items onto the table and it scribes the glyph."]
	quest.24974C509DC442F4.title: "First Glyphs"
	quest.24BEEC0B2D63AB40.quest_desc: ["The shotgun's shells: copper, gunpowder and iron nuggets make 18 at the Ammo Assembly Table. Create Armorer fills them with a spout as well."]
	quest.24BEEC0B2D63AB40.title: "12 Gauge Shells"
	quest.24EBF74646BCD91D.quest_desc: ["Wear a full set of uncommon gear and kill an Apothic Invader, then switch to Ascent."]
	quest.24EBF74646BCD91D.title: "World Tier: Ascent"
	quest.25D3EE9E6CC40E70.quest_desc: ["Shulkers hide in the cities' walls as purpur boxes, and their bullets make you float. They sometimes drop their shell."]
	quest.25D3EE9E6CC40E70.title: "Shulker Shells"
	quest.25FE4152DE215902.quest_desc: ["Cut tentacles and dough in the cooking pot."]
	quest.25FE4152DE215902.title: "Squid Rings"
	quest.2617388B88D71E1F.quest_desc: ["Zinc ore and deepslate zinc ore generate in the world. Smelt or blast the ore, or the raw zinc it drops, into zinc ingots."]
	quest.2617388B88D71E1F.title: "Zinc"
	quest.262266C88EFE0478.quest_desc: ["Set foot in all four of Better Dungeons' dungeons: a monster room, a skeleton dungeon, a spider cave and a zombie catacomb."]
	quest.262266C88EFE0478.title: "Professional Dungeoneer"
	quest.268E21E25F235E78.quest_desc: ["An iron sheet, a redstone dust and a train casing make a train coupler, from Steam 'n' Rails. Placed on a track, it couples and uncouples the carriages of a train that stops on it."]
	quest.268E21E25F235E78.title: "Train Coupler"
	quest.26BC5EE9D20A5747.quest_desc: ["Two brass sheets, a precision mechanism and a lever, on the mechanical crafters."]
	quest.26BC5EE9D20A5747.title: "Trigger Mechanism"
	quest.26E56C8A7F2ADC32.quest_desc: ["A golden sheet and a copper ingot make a steam whistle. On a boiler's tank, it sounds on a redstone signal, its pitch set by how many you stack."]
	quest.26E56C8A7F2ADC32.title: "Steam Whistle"
	quest.271C58BD203F0D96.quest_desc: ["Three popped chorus fruit, four end stone bricks and a campfire: a stove for the chef of the End."]
	quest.271C58BD203F0D96.title: "End Stove"
	quest.2755B91BF7351A20.quest_desc: ["Alex's Mobs' lobsters drop tails: cut one on the board, cook the meat on a campfire, then add a milk bottle, a tomato and an onion in the pot."]
	quest.2755B91BF7351A20.title: "Lobster Bisque"
	quest.276DE76595C1E945.quest_desc: ["Two sturdy sheets and a fluid tank make a fuel tank, from Steam 'n' Rails. Built into a train, it holds liquid fuel for the engine."]
	quest.276DE76595C1E945.title: "Fuel Tank"
	quest.276EBEB807DD35E5.quest_desc: ["The tesla coil charges gold wire into electrum wire, and gold ingots into electrum. Roll gold sheets into gold wire first."]
	quest.276EBEB807DD35E5.title: "Electrum Wire"
	quest.27EAE20228BADC68.quest_desc: ["A button, an andesite casing and an electron tube make contraption controls. Riding on a contraption, they switch its drills, saws and harvesters on and off."]
	quest.27EAE20228BADC68.title: "Contraption Controls"
	quest.28D5964A1BDAC16D.quest_desc: ["It unlocks the Citadel's vaults."]
	quest.28D5964A1BDAC16D.title: "Decrepit Key"
	quest.297847E6A402C283.quest_desc: ["Use the heart on the reinforced deepslate frame at an ancient city's centre, and it's spent opening a portal. Through it is the Otherside, a dimension of sculk below the bedrock."]
	quest.297847E6A402C283.title: "The Otherside"
	quest.2990DCDA19CB83CF.quest_desc: ["The rolling mill makes two iron rods from an iron ingot. Copper and gold rods are rolled the same way."]
	quest.2990DCDA19CB83CF.title: "Iron Rods"
	quest.299214CE85FAF453.quest_desc: ["A slimeball on a mechanical piston makes it sticky, so it pulls its contraption back as well as pushing it out."]
	quest.299214CE85FAF453.title: "Sticky Mechanical Piston"
	quest.29951DB86B5CBE0E.quest_desc: ["Fill it with telejuice, pair it with a TP link, and stand on it to go to the paired destination. The item and block teleporters do the same for items and blocks on a redstone signal, and the custom portal reaches across dimensions."]
	quest.29951DB86B5CBE0E.title: "Entity Teleporter"
	quest.29BC97FFB38ACEBA.quest_desc: ["Light on durability and very fast. Four azure silver, two gold and an ender pearl make one at a crafting table; the alloy forge makes three from a block of azure silver."]
	quest.29BC97FFB38ACEBA.title: "Azure Electrum"
	quest.29D0DB23B08C9878.quest_desc: ["A blaze burner and an anvil, upgraded at a smithing table with a blaze upgrade template. Fed liquid experience it works as an anvil with no repair cost, and it can apply enchanting templates or strip an enchantment into one."]
	quest.29D0DB23B08C9878.title: "Blaze Forger"
	quest.29D7F6CADBDA8508.quest_desc: ["Given heat from below, it slowly turns, and faster with more heat. A solar heating plate makes heat during the day."]
	quest.29D7F6CADBDA8508.title: "Stirling Engine"
	quest.29F2892F2A225F74.quest_desc: ["Organic compost slowly decays into rich soil, which gives crops planted on it a chance of a bone meal boost. Mushroom colonies need it too."]
	quest.29F2892F2A225F74.title: "Rich Soil"
	quest.2A5B9C95BF5399D0.quest_desc: ["The same for biomes: four saplings, four logs and a compass. Handy when a structure only generates in one kind of biome."]
	quest.2A5B9C95BF5399D0.title: "Nature's Compass"
	quest.2A79497B1BEC7A8A.quest_desc: ["Smelt a book. Cooking for Blockheads I shows the food you can make right now from what you carry."]
	quest.2A79497B1BEC7A8A.title: "Cooking for Blockheads"
	quest.2A994F9F5FE41D1A.quest_desc: ["Place it below a pipe and it sprinkles the fluid over what's beneath. Water keeps farmland wet, and other fluids affect mobs differently."]
	quest.2A994F9F5FE41D1A.title: "Sprinkler"
	quest.2AF913BCDD8C451F.quest_desc: ["Polished deepslate and crying obsidian. It forges a scroll from ink, paper and a spell's focus; the ink sets the scroll's rarity."]
	quest.2AF913BCDD8C451F.title: "Scroll Forge"
	quest.2B18E2CB3DF9F33B.quest_desc: ["At a smithing table, the warden template and a reinforced echo shard turn a netherite chestplate into a warden one. The full set takes four of each."]
	quest.2B18E2CB3DF9F33B.title: "Warden Armour"
	quest.2B3E9EA3CA32E298.quest_desc: ["Two iron and a stick. Craft it with a fish to cut fillets; the bigger the fish, the more you get."]
	quest.2B3E9EA3CA32E298.title: "Iron Fillet Knife"
	quest.2B4A4B050D0ABEF5.quest_desc: ["Sugar, cocoa butter, cocoa beans and milk mix into dark chocolate in a heated basin; press it into bars in a basin. White and ruby chocolate have recipes of their own."]
	quest.2B4A4B050D0ABEF5.title: "Dark Chocolate"
	quest.2B5899321CCD9012.quest_desc: ["A block of experience, a sponge and a copper casing. It soaks up experience from nearby players and orbs, glowing brighter the more it holds, and works on a contraption too."]
	quest.2B5899321CCD9012.title: "Experience Lantern"
	quest.2B705A65E88D98CC.quest_desc: ["Eight phylactery shards and a soul lantern. Use it on the Dead King's soul to raise him for another fight."]
	quest.2B705A65E88D98CC.title: "Dead King Phylactery"
	quest.2BA0D84C6A29B165.quest_desc: ["Six dried kelp make a mechanical belt. Use it on two shafts in a line and it joins them with a belt that carries items, and anything standing on it, as the shafts turn."]
	quest.2BA0D84C6A29B165.title: "Mechanical Belt"
	quest.2BEA4829F7D07D10.quest_desc: ["A netherite space suit with calorite plates, two calorite tanks, a calorite engine and two etrionic capacitors. It works like the netherite suit, with jets that throw you forward."]
	quest.2BEA4829F7D07D10.title: "Jet Suit"
	quest.2C616CFA17688B7E.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm's bosses each wait in an arena of their own. Craft the arena's eye from an eye of ender and what the place is made of, and throw it to find the way. Tick the box when you're ready."]
	quest.2C616CFA17688B7E.title: "L_Ender's Cataclysm"
	quest.2C877FE642C7AB4C.quest_desc: ["Gold, phantom membranes, a bone and rotten flesh around an eye of ender. It leads to the Frosted Prison, in snowy plains."]
	quest.2C877FE642C7AB4C.title: "Eye of Curse"
	quest.2C8DFC520679DCAC.quest_desc: ["Pump the blast furnace's molten steel into the casting basin: 144 mB casts one ingot. Steel is what the oil rigs, engines and rockets after this are built from."]
	quest.2C8DFC520679DCAC.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.2DA6D02307D9BB90.quest_desc: ["Sugar and a slimeball in a heated basin make eight marshmallows."]
	quest.2DA6D02307D9BB90.title: "Marshmallow"
	quest.2DA769C81544028B.quest_desc: ["Soul sand valleys are full of it. Four in a T is the Wither's body, and soul soil works as well."]
	quest.2DA769C81544028B.title: "Soul Sand"
	quest.2DF5FE4AA5616E90.quest_desc: ["Eight iron around a backpack, keeping what's inside: more slots and more upgrade slots. Copper, gold, diamond and netherite each go one tier further."]
	quest.2DF5FE4AA5616E90.title: "Iron Backpack"
	quest.2E205DF4A005B094.quest_desc: ["A slimeball, an item vault and an andesite alloy make a package frogport. Set on a chain conveyor, it sends packages along the chain and catches the ones addressed to it."]
	quest.2E205DF4A005B094.title: "Package Frogport"
	quest.2E2B5001B725B899.quest_desc: ["Set the base on top of the pipe from the deposit, the hammer holder behind it, the connector and head above, joined by hammer parts and super glued. A machine input under the crank takes the rotation that drives it, and crude oil comes out of the base."]
	quest.2E2B5001B725B899.title: "Pumpjack"
	quest.2EAE369A1FB4E030.quest_desc: [
		"Put a barrel, a trigger and a firing mechanism on the mechanical crafters with the rest of a gun's recipe: the \"Stress\" Auto Pistol adds a block of brass and a plank. The \"Crank\" SMG, the \"Bearing\" Shotgun and the \"Crane\" Assult Rifle are made the same way."
		"Tick this once one comes off the crafters. A gun from the Weapon Station doesn't count."
	]
	quest.2EAE369A1FB4E030.title: "A Mechanically Crafted Gun"
	quest.2EC24750F1A6E051.quest_desc: ["Two bricks, a wooden shovel, five iron and a water bucket. Set it on a stove, campfire or fire and cook meals of several ingredients, served in a bowl."]
	quest.2EC24750F1A6E051.title: "Cooking Pot"
	quest.2EF693E8E64154B9.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from diamonds, overcharged diamonds, iron sheets, a brass casing and a block of redstone. The strongest motor."]
	quest.2EF693E8E64154B9.title: "Reinforced Motor"
	quest.2F578ABDDEC5FC50.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Jungle Temples replaces the vanilla one with a bigger temple. Look in a jungle."]
	quest.2F578ABDDEC5FC50.title: "A Jungle Temple"
	quest.2F73106C6AD0BDD4.quest_desc: ["Make one from gold ingots, four arcane essence and two hogskin, which hoglins drop: a gold-bound book with room for more spells than the tome."]
	quest.2F73106C6AD0BDD4.title: "Apprentice's Spell Book"
	quest.2F7E1B53608FC57B.quest_desc: ["Cut chorus fruit on the board for four grains. Chorus grows on the End's outer islands."]
	quest.2F7E1B53608FC57B.title: "Chorus Fruit Grain"
	quest.2F7EA6158CFA5B5D.quest_desc: ["Stand near heat and hold food in your other hand to cook on the go, or sneak to place the skillet on a stove as a block."]
	quest.2F7EA6158CFA5B5D.title: "Skillet"
	quest.2FB357D1CB1E49B9.quest_desc: ["Two iron sheets and an iron ingot make four chutes. Items fall down a chute, and an encased fan blows them up one."]
	quest.2FB357D1CB1E49B9.title: "Chutes"
	quest.2FB85C3CBDDB9066.quest_desc: ["Give it a gun and ammo and it fires at what comes near, on FE power. Set it to save ammo or fire as fast as the gun allows, and whether it shoots players."]
	quest.2FB85C3CBDDB9066.title: "Turret"
	quest.3000B59F6C0D5ED1.quest_desc: ["Ignis drops it. At a smithing table, with an ignitium upgrade template, it turns netherite armor into ignitium."]
	quest.3000B59F6C0D5ED1.title: "Ignitium Ingot"
	quest.300B62A053112DE3.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Dungeons rebuilds the old monster room and adds skeleton, spider and zombie dungeons underground. Find any of them."]
	quest.300B62A053112DE3.title: "A Dungeon"
	quest.3026A843F2423034.quest_desc: ["An andesite casing and a lightning rod. Given electricity and rotation, it energises items on a depot or belt under it."]
	quest.3026A843F2423034.title: "Basic Energiser"
	quest.3153A87E7D07CA8E.quest_desc: ["Prismarine bricks, a potion, a bookshelf and a pufferfish. The ocean's shelf."]
	quest.3153A87E7D07CA8E.title: "Seashelf"
	quest.31597E1ECB363882.quest_desc: ["It burns honey for power. Speed upgrades raise its output, Productivity ones lower its honey use."]
	quest.31597E1ECB363882.title: "Honey Generator"
	quest.315DBBB07CA780AC.quest_desc: ["Cracked deepslate tiles and books make a Dormant Deepshelf, which wakes at a table with 60 eterna, 40 quanta and 40 arcana. It takes a table of infused shelves to get there."]
	quest.315DBBB07CA780AC.title: "Deepshelf"
	quest.319BAB19D9033039.quest_desc: ["Planks and red wool. Place it and a merchant appears, selling seeds, saplings and bone meal for an emerald each."]
	quest.319BAB19D9033039.title: "Market"
	quest.31ADBA74FD5E78BD.quest_desc: ["Ender chests, four infused shelves and an enchanting table. It stores enchanted books as points per enchantment and hands back any level it has the points for."]
	quest.31ADBA74FD5E78BD.title: "Enchantment Library"
	quest.320288D9DAF71E39.quest_desc: ["Purpur, shulker shells and end stone bricks around an eye of ender. It leads to the Ruined Citadel, on the End's outer islands."]
	quest.320288D9DAF71E39.title: "Eye of Void"
	quest.32259CD68BAF70F0.quest_desc: ["Five red grapes press into red grape pomace, in a basin or by hand; the cellar matures it into Bordeaux. White grape pomace makes the white wines, and both make rosé."]
	quest.32259CD68BAF70F0.title: "Bordeaux"
	quest.32B6F81B4DFB5527.quest_desc: ["Six crying obsidian (from ruined portals, fortress chests and piglin bartering) and three glowstone. Charged with glowstone it sets your spawn in the Nether; anywhere else it explodes."]
	quest.32B6F81B4DFB5527.title: "Respawn Anchor"
	quest.32FDA4F6A3426DED.quest_desc: ["The Wither drops it, and it won't burn or blow up."]
	quest.32FDA4F6A3426DED.title: "Nether Star"
	quest.3317C91466835DB7.quest_desc: ["Wear a full set of affix items: helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots and something in hand. Then switch to Frontier with Ctrl+T. Each tier up makes mobs and loot stronger."]
	quest.3317C91466835DB7.title: "World Tier: Frontier"
	quest.3360689BF4EA0CBE.quest_desc: ["An andesite alloy and a dried kelp make two andesite funnels, and twice that two andesite tunnels. A funnel puts items onto a belt or takes them off into a chest; a tunnel on a belt splits what passes under it between the belts beside it."]
	quest.3360689BF4EA0CBE.title: "Andesite Funnels and Tunnels"
	quest.33A3CB901281922B.quest_desc: ["Rerolls an item's affixes, common to rare, for levels and its rarity's material. From uncommon up it takes Sigils of Rebirth too."]
	quest.33A3CB901281922B.title: "Simple Reforging Table"
	quest.33A61C13CFCF2BC5.quest_desc: ["Sixteen andesite alloy, four planks and a stone make two crushing wheels on the mechanical crafters. Set the pair side by side and spin them toward each other, and whatever drops between them is crushed."]
	quest.33A61C13CFCF2BC5.title: "Crushing Wheels"
	quest.34190BDBA66CAA2E.quest_desc: ["Blaze powder and an ender pearl. Thrown, an eye flies toward the nearest stronghold and sometimes shatters; the portal needs up to twelve."]
	quest.34190BDBA66CAA2E.title: "Eyes of Ender"
	quest.3429657A59646011.quest_desc: ["Found in ancient city chests and on the Citadel's bookshelves. Create's sequenced assembly can also restore one from an enchanted book, about one time in three."]
	quest.3429657A59646011.title: "Ruined Book"
	quest.3435FF74088244E2.quest_desc: ["Makes the backpack pick up items straight into itself, with a filter for which."]
	quest.3435FF74088244E2.title: "Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.344FEF9CBCB92AE7.quest_desc: ["An andesite casing, a wool and an iron sheet make a rope pulley. It lowers the blocks below it on a rope, and raises them again when it turns the other way."]
	quest.344FEF9CBCB92AE7.title: "Rope Pulley"
	quest.351BD674E58C2F69.quest_desc: ["Improves a material's grade, and with it the stats of the parts made from it, using a catalyst: glowing dust is the first tier. Its recipe takes blaze gold and an advanced upgrade base."]
	quest.351BD674E58C2F69.title: "Material Grader"
	quest.35BDE5862EFF104E.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Mineshafts replaces the vanilla ones with a mineshaft for each biome. Any of them counts."]
	quest.35BDE5862EFF104E.title: "A Mineshaft"
	quest.35D4B710992C8F85.quest_desc: ["An electron tube, an andesite casing and a brass hand make a deployer. It's the machine that assembles the precision mechanism."]
	quest.35D4B710992C8F85.title: "Deployer"
	quest.35E14EC36F495943.quest_desc: ["The same with a gold rod: it carries more power, over longer wires."]
	quest.35E14EC36F495943.title: "Large Connector"
	quest.360F225963289D85.quest_desc: ["Smelted from the raw calorite mined on Venus."]
	quest.360F225963289D85.title: "Calorite Ingot"
	quest.3663F8649F2050C9.quest_desc: ["The mechanical crafters make an extendo grip from a brass hand, a precision mechanism, a brass ingot and sticks. Held in the off hand, it lets you reach blocks much further away."]
	quest.3663F8649F2050C9.title: "Extendo Grip"
	quest.36C11FA792F77331.quest_desc: ["Squids drop tentacles; cut them on the board for three pieces each."]
	quest.36C11FA792F77331.title: "Cut Tentacles"
	quest.36D48965C918D447.quest_desc: ["A blaze burner and an enchanting table, upgraded the same way. Fed liquid experience it enchants like a table, at the level you set on its panel; an item in its filter limits it to that item's enchantments."]
	quest.36D48965C918D447.title: "Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.36D546DE6DC7ACE0.quest_desc: ["Four new crops grow wild across many climates: cabbages, tomatoes, onions and wild rice. Cut wild rice on the board for grains of rice, and plant them in a shallow puddle of water."]
	quest.36D546DE6DC7ACE0.title: "Wild Crops"
	quest.374C4049CF5E16C7.quest_desc: ["Use an item on a placed spawner to change it: sugar shortens its delay, a fermented spider eye spawns more, a comparator gives it a redstone switch, a soul lantern lets it work in any light."]
	quest.374C4049CF5E16C7.title: "Just a Few Tweaks..."
	quest.3770784E5E24E8F3.quest_desc: ["A packager turns into a re-packager on a crafting table. It unpacks packages and packs their contents again, so orders split across several packages arrive as one."]
	quest.3770784E5E24E8F3.title: "Re-Packager"
	quest.38965C68E66CDFC8.quest_desc: ["Obsidian and crying obsidian around an eye of ender. It leads to the Sunken City, at the bottom of a deep ocean."]
	quest.38965C68E66CDFC8.title: "Eye of Abyss"
	quest.3A0A747DDB701D9B.quest_desc: ["A deployer, a rotation speed controller, a large and a small cogwheel and a flint and steel, on the mechanical crafters. The dearest part of a gun."]
	quest.3A0A747DDB701D9B.title: "Firing Mechanism"
	quest.3A1CC98B34459587.quest_desc: ["A guardian, an onion, two eggs and two tomatoes in the cooking pot. Guardians drop the guardian itself; ocean monuments are where they live."]
	quest.3A1CC98B34459587.title: "Guardian Soup"
	quest.3A50BA47D130CDD3.quest_desc: ["Found in fortress chests. It grows only on soul sand, and nearly every potion starts from it."]
	quest.3A50BA47D130CDD3.title: "Nether Wart"
	quest.3A81744ED309674B.quest_desc: ["A pair of plates linked by a shard: insert a dormant shard into one to attune it, then bring it to the other. Sharestones teleport to any other of the same color, and portstones can be teleported from but not to."]
	quest.3A81744ED309674B.title: "Warp Plate"
	quest.3AA6E08BCA344734.quest_desc: ["A wooden door and a train casing make a train door. It opens on its own when the train stops at a station."]
	quest.3AA6E08BCA344734.title: "Train Door"
	quest.3B0C16BFF281F0F2.quest_desc: ["Gold, chiseled sandstone, an emerald, a cactus, a dead bush, a bone and rotten flesh around an eye of ender. It leads to the Cursed Pyramid, in the desert."]
	quest.3B0C16BFF281F0F2.title: "Eye of Desert"
	quest.3B1BA94AAFFA37A6.quest_desc: ["A deployer line builds it on the chassis, adding four wheels, the seat, the bumper, four exhausts and the motor. It comes out red, and dye makes it any other color."]
	quest.3B1BA94AAFFA37A6.title: "Red Kart"
	quest.3B7CF31CCE0DB47E.quest_desc: ["Built around a steam engine, and connects to a shaft like one. Give it fuel and it turns."]
	quest.3B7CF31CCE0DB47E.title: "Huge Diesel Engine"
	quest.3B8FDE5B8CB91501.quest_desc: ["The mechanical crafters make a wand of symmetry from glass, an ender pearl, a precision mechanism, a brass ingot and obsidian. Every block you place or break is mirrored across the plane you set."]
	quest.3B8FDE5B8CB91501.title: "Wand of Symmetry"
	quest.3CC436CC7D960F6C.quest_desc: ["A flying sea serpent that spits poison, near the coast. Not a boss, but it fights like one."]
	quest.3CC436CC7D960F6C.title: "A Naga"
	quest.3CD3E7BFB55DAB51.quest_desc: ["Packed gunpowder, pressed from three gunpowder, in an empty charge of string and wool. A cast iron cannon needs one charge per barrel to fire the shot clear, and bursts on more than two."]
	quest.3CD3E7BFB55DAB51.title: "Powder Charge"
	quest.3CF5162DCCD738D4.quest_desc: ["Beat every wave of the Gateway of the First Frontier."]
	quest.3CF5162DCCD738D4.title: "Leave the Frontier"
	quest.3D1BB170E12701C3.quest_desc: ["An endshelf, ender pearls and the dragon's head. The strongest shelf there is."]
	quest.3D1BB170E12701C3.title: "Draconic Endshelf"
	quest.3D53C8374D66F693.quest_desc: ["Makes scopes, sights, muzzles, stocks, grips, lasers and extended magazines. Fit them to a gun in its inventory screen; each gun takes only some."]
	quest.3D53C8374D66F693.title: "TaCZ Attachment Table"
	quest.3D913DD0246529D6.quest_desc: ["Used on farmland: red fertilizer speeds up growth, green increases crop output, and yellow prevents trampling."]
	quest.3D913DD0246529D6.title: "Fertilizer"
	quest.3DB4704C88B0A42B.quest_desc: ["A brass sheet, a spout and three nixie tubes. Over a basin and among bookshelves, it does an enchanting table's infusion recipes with liquid experience."]
	quest.3DB4704C88B0A42B.title: "Infuser"
	quest.3DC3E416CB6F686D.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from twelve shafts and eight planks. It meshes with large cogwheels at a third of their speed and small ones at a sixth."]
	quest.3DC3E416CB6F686D.title: "Colossal Cogwheel"
	quest.3E2C7E69DB501D03.quest_desc: ["Two slimeballs, an iron sheet and an iron nugget make super glue. Use it to drag a box over blocks, and they move together as one contraption."]
	quest.3E2C7E69DB501D03.title: "Super Glue"
	quest.3E662A4D2B3BC8FF.quest_desc: ["Archwood planks and gold ingots. It imbues an item with Source, gathering it slowly by itself or drawing it from Source Jars within two blocks. Items on pedestals beside it are part of some recipes and aren't used up."]
	quest.3E662A4D2B3BC8FF.title: "Imbuement Chamber"
	quest.3E71F44F12261E16.quest_desc: ["Works like a mechanical piston with extension poles, and needs a ram head on the end. Disassemble the cannon first, and line up the loader, the munitions and the barrel."]
	quest.3E71F44F12261E16.title: "Cannon Loader"
	quest.3EB331B0CEEFE6AA.quest_desc: ["Heavy plates and steel rods. Place the rocket on it to launch; a redstone signal launches a placed rocket by itself."]
	quest.3EB331B0CEEFE6AA.title: "Launch Pad"
	quest.3ECA3305E628F895.quest_desc: ["When Dungeons Arise's largest airship, flying over forests, jungles, plains, savannas and deserts, and over the End's outer islands. Find one and climb aboard."]
	quest.3ECA3305E628F895.title: "A Heavenly Conqueror"
	quest.3EE94B64D98641DD.quest_desc: ["Rebar and a brass ingot. Deployers hold it to drive screws when they assemble steel mechanisms."]
	quest.3EE94B64D98641DD.title: "Screwdriver"
	quest.3F08DFF434222848.quest_desc: [
		"Eight iron on the mechanical crafters. Every Create Armorer gun on the crafters takes a barrel, a trigger and a firing mechanism."
		"The same guns can also be made at the Weapon Station, Create Armorer's TaCZ bench, but this chapter makes them with Create."
	]
	quest.3F08DFF434222848.title: "Gun Barrel"
	quest.3F33CD73F5C47DCF.quest_desc: ["An energized core, iron and copper sheets, a hopper and a bottle o' lightning on a mechanical crafter. It catches lightning bolts as liquid lightning. The first bottle comes from a charged creeper or a magic chest."]
	quest.3F33CD73F5C47DCF.title: "Channeler"
	quest.3F523886DD1C4542.quest_desc: ["Crush obsidian into powdered obsidian, then build a sturdy sheet on it by sequenced assembly: a spout pours on lava and a press flattens it. It's the toughest sheet Create makes."]
	quest.3F523886DD1C4542.title: "Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.3F787EC852D554C7.quest_desc: ["The cheapest pistol at the gun smith table: 16 iron and 5 logs. Make a fresh one for this quest; a gun that's been loaded or fired no longer counts. Guns wear as they fire and can jam once worn."]
	quest.3F787EC852D554C7.title: "M1911"
	quest.3F9CAA1304C43B82.quest_desc: ["Paper and blue dye make four sheets. Three boards and two sticks make a template, which works once; blueprint paper makes blueprints, which work every time."]
	quest.3F9CAA1304C43B82.title: "Blueprint Paper"
	quest.3FBD33D45FF5E7C9.quest_desc: ["The Dead King drops his Necronomicon, a spell book of his own, and The Blood Staff."]
	quest.3FBD33D45FF5E7C9.title: "The Dead King's Tome and Scepter"
	quest.3FF8CB1F92B4357D.quest_desc: ["Refines crude oil into rocket fuel. It runs on power: Ad Astra's coal generator burns anything a furnace does, or use Crafts & Additions' alternator. A tier 1 rocket also burns diesel, gasoline or kerosene straight from the distillation tower."]
	quest.3FF8CB1F92B4357D.title: "Fuel Refinery"
	quest.4068689FCBA54738.quest_desc: ["Mined from crimson iron ore in the Nether, in netherrack and blackstone, and smelted like iron."]
	quest.4068689FCBA54738.title: "Crimson Iron"
	quest.4084D55FDBE51583.quest_desc: ["The cheapest scope, eight iron and an amethyst shard, and the M16A4 takes it."]
	quest.4084D55FDBE51583.title: "Retro 3x Scope"
	quest.40D889BD937BEF25.quest_desc: ["Electricity starts with copper wire: a stonecutter makes two from a copper ingot, and the rolling mill makes it from copper sheets."]
	quest.40D889BD937BEF25.title: "Copper Wire"
	quest.419C229B9F3E776C.quest_desc: ["When Dungeons Arise's Plague Asylum, in forests and mountains."]
	quest.419C229B9F3E776C.title: "A Plague Asylum"
	quest.41C1C91A6AC7DA47.quest_desc: ["Single-use teleports from the mechanical crafter, three at a time: a warp scroll goes to a waystone you choose, a return scroll back to the last one you used."]
	quest.41C1C91A6AC7DA47.title: "Warp Scrolls"
	quest.41C839ED1B4A4F67.quest_desc: ["An andesite alloy on an andesite casing makes a depot. It holds one stack for a press, a spout or a deployer to work on, and a funnel or an arm can take it off again."]
	quest.41C839ED1B4A4F67.title: "Depot"
	quest.41CB4E66D45B5992.quest_desc: ["The Sculptor's reward for passing his challenge."]
	quest.41CB4E66D45B5992.title: "Earthrend Gauntlet"
	quest.42D18ECB404AA162.quest_desc: ["A shaft and a plank make a cogwheel, and a shaft and two planks make a large cogwheel. The precision mechanism at the end of this chapter takes five of each."]
	quest.42D18ECB404AA162.title: "Cogwheels"
	quest.42FAC795FA7878AD.quest_desc: ["A wooden slab, an andesite casing and a shaft make a mechanical bearing. Power it with a redstone signal or a turn of rotation and it spins whatever is attached to its face, as one moving contraption."]
	quest.42FAC795FA7878AD.title: "Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.430BC91B211B5870.quest_desc: ["Two copper sheets and a barrel make a fluid tank. Tanks placed together merge into one, up to three blocks across and as tall as you stack them."]
	quest.430BC91B211B5870.title: "Fluid Tank"
	quest.430E8B900918976B.quest_desc: ["Ancient Knights drop it. A superheated mixer makes eight from blaze powder and netherite scrap."]
	quest.430E8B900918976B.title: "Cinder Essence"
	quest.43440F667B05C3A8.quest_desc: ["An industrial casing, a propeller and a cogwheel: a heavier encased fan for bulk processing."]
	quest.43440F667B05C3A8.title: "Industrial Fan"
	quest.4344E26953141519.quest_desc: ["A cogwheel, an andesite casing and a whisk make a mechanical mixer. The whisk is two andesite alloy and five iron sheets."]
	quest.4344E26953141519.title: "Mechanical Mixer"
	quest.43A2BB7AF820DFAF.quest_desc: ["Gems drop alongside affix items. Your first gem dust comes from dropping a gem on the ground and letting an anvil fall on it; after that, the Salvaging Table breaks gems down."]
	quest.43A2BB7AF820DFAF.title: "Gem Dust"
	quest.44184E8CBC0338B8.quest_desc: ["An echo shard wrapped in four warden carapaces and four phantom membranes. Carapaces come from the Warden and, now and then, ancient city chests."]
	quest.44184E8CBC0338B8.title: "Reinforced Echo Shard"
	quest.4440B711812F947F.quest_desc: ["A lightning rod on four heavy plates."]
	quest.4440B711812F947F.title: "Rocket Nose Cone"
	quest.44638097D1B5911E.quest_desc: ["The mechanical press makes brass sheets from brass ingots. Four of them and an andesite alloy make the brass hand a deployer needs."]
	quest.44638097D1B5911E.title: "Brass Sheets"
	quest.4548E26475C7303D.quest_desc: ["Adds one socket to an item, for one more gem. Gem dust, gem-fused slate, gunpowder and an amethyst shard make three."]
	quest.4548E26475C7303D.title: "Sigil of Socketing"
	quest.4581013F8819B460.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from three copper spools, brass sheets, a capacitor, an iron rod and andesite alloy. It turns power back into rotation, at a speed you set."]
	quest.4581013F8819B460.title: "Electric Motor"
	quest.45FF46A2E52E9A59.quest_desc: ["Catch the dragon's purple breath in glass bottles while it lingers. Brewed into a splash potion it makes lingering potions."]
	quest.45FF46A2E52E9A59.title: "Dragon's Breath"
	quest.4623CEED0643A2A0.quest_desc: ["Hoglin loin and a potato in the cooking pot. Loin comes from hoglins, bastion stables and piglin bartering."]
	quest.4623CEED0643A2A0.title: "Spicy Hoglin Stew"
	quest.463036707566B60F.quest_desc: ["A golden sheet, a depot and a cogwheel make a weighted ejector. It throws what lands on it to a spot you pick, up to a few blocks away."]
	quest.463036707566B60F.title: "Weighted Ejector"
	quest.4632BB1D627937A7.quest_desc: ["Two iron sheets and a barrel make an item vault. Vaults placed together merge into one big store, up to three blocks across."]
	quest.4632BB1D627937A7.title: "Item Vault"
	quest.46B090983E584A01.quest_desc: ["Two andesite alloy, a slimeball, two cobblestone and a redstone dust make a sticker. On a redstone signal it grabs the block in front of it, or lets it go."]
	quest.46B090983E584A01.title: "Sticker"
	quest.46D04B131B7C6F45.quest_desc: ["Towns and Towers adds a village and a pillager outpost for most biomes. Find any village."]
	quest.46D04B131B7C6F45.title: "A Village"
	quest.46D1AA4DDCAA8301.quest_desc: ["Fill the portal frame's twelve slots with eyes (some may already hold one) and jump in. The only ways home are dying or beating the dragon."]
	quest.46D1AA4DDCAA8301.title: "The End"
	quest.46D53EF8DA9CDA57.quest_desc: ["A gas tank in five heavy plates with a steel rod: the rocket's fuel tanks. It takes two."]
	quest.46D53EF8DA9CDA57.title: "Steel Tank"
	quest.46E2F1F40DEBEFCD.quest_desc: ["Crispy fried perch from the cooking pot, a baked potato, tomato sauce and a bowl. Perch is one of Aquaculture's catches."]
	quest.46E2F1F40DEBEFCD.title: "Fish and Chips"
	quest.46ED55DF7CC6D5E0.quest_desc: ["A stonecutter makes eight from a steel ingot. Oil lies in deposits deep underground, and a pumpjack needs a line of industrial pipe from the deposit up to the surface."]
	quest.46ED55DF7CC6D5E0.title: "Industrial Pipe"
	quest.479C0B4F3E9AC3CA.quest_desc: ["Use a sturdy sheet on a brass casing, by hand or with a deployer, to make a train casing. Every train block is built around one."]
	quest.479C0B4F3E9AC3CA.title: "Train Casing"
	quest.47AB60A64629BD2B.quest_desc: ["Cold, airless and red, and the only place ostrum ore is found."]
	quest.47AB60A64629BD2B.title: "Mars"
	quest.47CDD6766DCC1EBD.quest_desc: ["Four straw make a canvas, for canvas signs and rugs."]
	quest.47CDD6766DCC1EBD.title: "Canvas"
	quest.47DA54993C21B47E.quest_desc: ["Five calorite plates, a fan and the ostrum engine."]
	quest.47DA54993C21B47E.title: "Calorite Engine"
	quest.47F297D4FA740428.quest_desc: ["Connects a separate group of storages to the controller. Link it with the storage tool."]
	quest.47F297D4FA740428.title: "Storage Link"
	quest.48EE318313205A87.quest_desc: ["Starbuncles wander woods looking for gold nuggets; hold one out and a starbuncle takes it and leaves a Starbuncle Token. The token and gold ingots at the apparatus make a charm that summons one to move items, set up with the dominion wand."]
	quest.48EE318313205A87.title: "Starbuncle Charm"
	quest.48F91C7BE0BE1E7A.quest_desc: ["Most of the ways to travel in this pack are built in a mechanical crafter: waystones, karts, jetpacks and teleporters each have a branch from here. Tick this to open them."]
	quest.48F91C7BE0BE1E7A.title: "Getting Around"
	quest.4903F92F10507ABD.quest_desc: ["Three sheets of blueprint paper over two sticks. Every tool, weapon and armor piece has one, and holding Alt over a blueprint shows the tool's recipe."]
	quest.4903F92F10507ABD.title: "Pickaxe Blueprint"
	quest.49E283491F47C049.quest_desc: ["Bores out cast cannon blocks. It needs rotation and water, drinks more water the faster it turns, and its speed must match the lathe turning the cast."]
	quest.49E283491F47C049.title: "Cannon Drill"
	quest.4B0F1278608B561F.quest_desc: ["Planks and a slab. It turns grape pomace into wine, and apple must into cider. Red and white grapes grow wild in plains and forests."]
	quest.4B0F1278608B561F.title: "Wine Cellar"
	quest.4C2D4A064389BFF6.quest_desc: ["A storage terminal with a crafting table built in, crafting from what the network holds."]
	quest.4C2D4A064389BFF6.title: "Crafting Terminal"
	quest.4C844D1D2D6389AF.quest_desc: ["A block of experience used on a fluid hatch. Right-click it to store your experience as liquid, and shift-right-click to take it back."]
	quest.4C844D1D2D6389AF.title: "Experience Hatch"
	quest.4D122DC8E2842FB4.quest_desc: ["Eight copper ingots around a block of andesite alloy. Turned by a shaft and surrounded by magnets it makes electricity; it never turns anything itself."]
	quest.4D122DC8E2842FB4.title: "Generator Coil"
	quest.4DDE66EF4636C544.quest_desc: ["Temples of gloomslate stand in the Otherside. Their chests hold soul dust, soul crystals and sculk bones."]
	quest.4DDE66EF4636C544.title: "An Ancient Temple"
	quest.4E032225DAD42979.quest_desc: ["Raw fillets cook in a furnace, smoker or on a campfire."]
	quest.4E032225DAD42979.title: "Cooked Fish Fillet"
	quest.4E03C2567F5E822B.quest_desc: ["The mechanical press flattens an iron ingot into an iron sheet. Sheets go into the mixer's whisk, the blaze burner and the electron tube."]
	quest.4E03C2567F5E822B.title: "Iron Sheets"
	quest.4E113836457588C5.quest_desc: ["Fly, swim and move faster, on fuel: refill it with a fueling tank, or drop coal with the jetpack in your offhand. It takes a heat engine and four encased fans."]
	quest.4E113836457588C5.title: "Andesite Jetpack"
	quest.4E566D1A38D22D74.quest_desc: ["One in the furnace's wall takes in hot air. One on the top hole collects furnace gas, and items sent into it fall into the furnace."]
	quest.4E566D1A38D22D74.title: "Blast Furnace Hatch"
	quest.4E7EF2D4F796BEC5.quest_desc: ["Blind, it hunts by sound and smell, and hits harder than anything else in the Overworld. Throw snowballs or arrows to draw it off, or fight it with Sculk Smite."]
	quest.4E7EF2D4F796BEC5.title: "The Warden"
	quest.4E9989ABF7317C57.quest_desc: ["A wooden slab, a brass casing and an electron tube make a clockwork bearing. It turns two contraptions as the hands of a clock, keeping the time of day."]
	quest.4E9989ABF7317C57.title: "Clockwork Bearing"
	quest.4F13780A7ADD78BE.quest_desc: ["Netherite scrap and four steel ingots, or eight cast iron, in a superheated mixer make eight. Molten, it casts the strongest cannons, for the heaviest charges."]
	quest.4F13780A7ADD78BE.title: "Nethersteel Ingot"
	quest.4F87995FA90727E9.quest_desc: ["A shaft carries rotation from one Create machine to the next. Make one from andesite alloy."]
	quest.4F87995FA90727E9.title: "A Shaft"
	quest.4FF888A38D24CA23.quest_desc: ["A precision mechanism, a brass casing, iron sheets and redstone make eight. Unpowered, it charges from the rotation in front of it; given a redstone signal, it gives that stress back to the network."]
	quest.4FF888A38D24CA23.title: "Kinetic Battery"
	quest.50050FE8336BC82F.quest_desc: ["Use a gate pearl to open a gateway: waves of mobs to beat for loot. Each world tier has its own, and the Gateway of the First Frontier is crafted from spider eyes, iron, bones, an ender pearl and rotten flesh. Gateways' own pearls, for blazes, endermen or slimes, count too."]
	quest.50050FE8336BC82F.title: "A Gate Pearl"
	quest.5017F477DFE6690A.quest_desc: ["Two shells around a chest: a box that keeps everything in it when it's broken and carried."]
	quest.5017F477DFE6690A.title: "Shulker Box"
	quest.504D351FBD9ED049.quest_desc: ["Blow crushed raw iron through water with an encased fan, and each one washes into nine iron nuggets, often with a redstone dust beside them. That's more iron per ore than smelting."]
	quest.504D351FBD9ED049.quest_subtitle: "Tick this once you've washed some"
	quest.504D351FBD9ED049.title: "Bulk Washing"
	quest.50830DC011F1AAC9.quest_desc: ["Found in chests: the catacombs' vaults and walls, the Citadel, and ancient and end cities."]
	quest.50830DC011F1AAC9.title: "Ancient Knowledge Fragment"
	quest.50945047535E98D1.quest_desc: ["Netherite armour (the Nether chapter's netherite) plated with ostrum, the suit with large gas tanks and an oxygen gear too. It keeps out extreme heat as well as cold."]
	quest.50945047535E98D1.title: "Netherite Space Suit"
	quest.510A1692BF039F8D.quest_desc: ["Kitchen blocks placed side by side form one kitchen. The cooking table, made with Cooking for Blockheads II, crafts food from what the counters and fridge hold."]
	quest.510A1692BF039F8D.title: "A Kitchen"
	quest.514BD1F485694ACB.quest_desc: ["A marshmallow glazed with chocolate from a spout."]
	quest.514BD1F485694ACB.title: "Chocolate Glazed Marshmallow"
	quest.5185A9DE4E946DB0.quest_desc: ["Tongbi, the Sculptor, waits in his monastery. He isn't fought: he raises a pillar, and you climb it to the top while he tries to knock you off. Don't fall."]
	quest.5185A9DE4E946DB0.title: "The Sculptor's Challenge"
	quest.518D3A98728FCC32.quest_desc: ["A sequenced assembly on a sturdy sheet: an advanced component, then telejuice from a spout. Telejuice is mixed in a heated basin, and redstone pearls are ender pearls mixed with rose quartz."]
	quest.518D3A98728FCC32.title: "Quantum Mechanism"
	quest.51CE3697587C7ED6.quest_desc: ["A frozen planet around Proxima Centauri, and the only one where you can breathe without a suit."]
	quest.51CE3697587C7ED6.title: "Glacio"
	quest.51F8C05DDB6B2E5F.quest_desc: ["A rifle from the gun smith table: 36 iron, 8 lapis and 6 logs. Make a fresh one for this quest."]
	quest.51F8C05DDB6B2E5F.title: "M16A4 Service Rifle"
	quest.521803A908C4BFE3.quest_desc: ["Planks, two honeycombs, a beehive, a campfire and shears. It houses Productive Bees' bees, which bring back combs of their own kind; bees come from nests found across the world, and more are bred."]
	quest.521803A908C4BFE3.title: "Advanced Beehive"
	quest.5244761B280AD1DA.quest_desc: ["Eight planks around a shaft make a water wheel."]
	quest.5244761B280AD1DA.title: "Water Wheel"
	quest.524C21F9F93613CD.quest_desc: ["Iron, a daylight detector and a hay bale. Give it honey treats and it grows caged baby bees up."]
	quest.524C21F9F93613CD.title: "BaBee Incubator"
	quest.5257B2EC0F15ABDD.quest_desc: ["Iron and gold ingots run under an energiser come out overcharged. Better magnets, energisers, motors and the boiler heater are made from them."]
	quest.5257B2EC0F15ABDD.title: "Overcharged Metals"
	quest.52CA7AE24F66B168.quest_desc: ["Eight andesite alloy and a shaft. Use one on an item drain to make a grindstone drain and set another on top: it grinds experience nuggets and blocks into liquid experience. It also does a grindstone's and sand paper's work."]
	quest.52CA7AE24F66B168.title: "Mechanical Grindstone"
	quest.52E43BB62D3E15DF.quest_desc: ["Two iron sheets and an iron rod make 24 empty spools to wind wire onto."]
	quest.52E43BB62D3E15DF.title: "Empty Spools"
	quest.5330F7AF68993D87.quest_desc: ["Iron ingots and nuggets on a wooden slab: the plainest projectile."]
	quest.5330F7AF68993D87.title: "Solid Shot"
	quest.533D688BC6018EEE.quest_desc: ["A Novice Spell Book with obsidian, diamonds, blocks of quartz and blaze rods. It reaches the second tier of glyphs and keeps every glyph the novice book knew."]
	quest.533D688BC6018EEE.title: "Mage's Spell Book"
	quest.537D3B2C4686E445.quest_desc: ["Ghasts drift over the lava seas and spit fireballs; hit one back at them. A slain ghast drops its tear, for potions of regeneration and end crystals."]
	quest.537D3B2C4686E445.title: "Ghast Tear"
	quest.53D84D69C8318882.quest_desc: ["Pipe fuel into it and it fuels a rocket or rover nearby, so a rocket on its pad can be refuelled without buckets."]
	quest.53D84D69C8318882.title: "Fuel Loader"
	quest.5443668589EE1D52.quest_desc: ["Overcharged iron and gold make four, stronger than redstone magnets. Fluxuated magnetite and netherite magnets are stronger still."]
	quest.5443668589EE1D52.title: "Layered Magnet"
	quest.544FAEE2C9689280.quest_desc: ["Three iron sheets, an iron ingot and an andesite casing make a mechanical saw. On a contraption it fells whole trees; set flat, it cuts logs into planks."]
	quest.544FAEE2C9689280.title: "Mechanical Saw"
	quest.5485D0AFB9E2DB70.quest_desc: ["Holds a stack of one kind of ammo, and a gun reloads from it. Iron, gold and diamond boxes hold more each. It fits a Curios slot, and Shift and right-click gathers loose ammo into it."]
	quest.5485D0AFB9E2DB70.title: "Ammo Box"
	quest.551B1E5C05CFEE78.quest_desc: ["Ancient cities lie in the deep dark, far below y 0 under sculk. Move sneaking: shriekers that hear you too often summon the Warden."]
	quest.551B1E5C05CFEE78.title: "An Ancient City"
	quest.552E28CF59007490.quest_desc: ["Five desh plates, a fan and a steel engine. Each engine is built around the one before."]
	quest.552E28CF59007490.title: "Desh Engine"
	quest.55D081D6B8FDA4B2.quest_desc: ["Closest to the sun and 167 degrees at the surface, so the netherite space suit goes here too."]
	quest.55D081D6B8FDA4B2.title: "Mercury"
	quest.55D93DE64B5FA0BA.quest_desc: ["A mechanical press, a fluid tank and a block of copper: Dreams and Desires' press for its hydraulic compacting recipes."]
	quest.55D93DE64B5FA0BA.title: "Hydraulic Press"
	quest.55DAAAE2F82BB588.quest_desc: ["Fireproof bricks, a cast iron pipe and cast iron ingots. Pump molten metal into it and it casts ingots."]
	quest.55DAAAE2F82BB588.title: "Casting Basin"
	quest.55ECCA33AF4870E4.quest_desc: ["Archwood slabs, logs and gold nuggets; archwood grows in the world's archwood forests. Use your spell book on it to open the codex, where each glyph costs a few items and some experience."]
	quest.55ECCA33AF4870E4.title: "Scribe's Table"
	quest.567122518A92E9A3.quest_desc: ["A pickup upgrade with ender pearls: it pulls items and experience in from around you as well."]
	quest.567122518A92E9A3.title: "Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.56B3521E1D816920.quest_desc: ["Four arcane essence, four iron ingots and a soul lantern. The trapped soul inside points toward its home: the catacombs."]
	quest.56B3521E1D816920.title: "Wayward Compass"
	quest.575E0DE6849C913D.quest_desc: ["Two andesite alloy make eight shafts on a crafting table. Shafts go into over a hundred recipes, the cogwheels, the water wheel and the mechanical press among them."]
	quest.575E0DE6849C913D.title: "Shafts"
	quest.57CD989ECD4DE9D1.quest_desc: ["Blazes swarm the fortress's spawners and drop rods when slain. Ground to powder they fuel a brewing stand and, with ender pearls, make the eyes of ender that lead to the End."]
	quest.57CD989ECD4DE9D1.title: "Blaze Rods"
	quest.5832952C9BEE4718.quest_desc: ["Five andesite alloy make a basin. The mixer's recipes need one."]
	quest.5832952C9BEE4718.title: "Basin"
	quest.58B346372AE55703.quest_desc: ["Mined from azure silver ore in the End, and smelted."]
	quest.58B346372AE55703.title: "Azure Silver"
	quest.58CDAC04BBAD4220.quest_desc: ["Vexing archwood, wilden drops and a block of lapis. With a Wilden Spike, Horn and Wing beside the brazier it summons the Wilden Chimera, a mid-level boss for a caster with tier two spells. It drops the Wilden Tribute."]
	quest.58CDAC04BBAD4220.title: "Ritual of Summon Wilden"
	quest.5906D50189533688.quest_desc: ["Slice and Dice cooks the cooking pot's meals in a heated basin with a mechanical mixer, bowl and all. Central Kitchen makes a blaze burner a heat source for the cooking pot itself, and lets a funnel take the food out."]
	quest.5906D50189533688.title: "Soup by the Batch"
	quest.594F415ECB2C331F.quest_desc: ["Builds Small Ships' ships, in nearby water deep enough for them, from the materials you bring, and installs their upgrades."]
	quest.594F415ECB2C331F.title: "Dockyard"
	quest.595FBD8B750C00AC.quest_desc: ["When Dungeons Arise adds forty structures, from wells to airships, most with their own mobs and loot. Its Illager Fort stands in snowy plains and taigas."]
	quest.595FBD8B750C00AC.title: "An Illager Fort"
	quest.5993625E2D28292A.quest_desc: ["A honeycomb and a honey bottle. It calms an angry bee, and coaxes a bee out of a nest."]
	quest.5993625E2D28292A.title: "Honey Treat"
	quest.59A7A2DB52B40D40.quest_desc: ["Iron, a smooth stone slab and glass. It fills glass bottles with honey."]
	quest.59A7A2DB52B40D40.title: "Bottler"
	quest.5A2404D93E4218BD.quest_desc: ["Dreams and Desires' casing: a zinc ingot used on copper casing, by hand or with a deployer."]
	quest.5A2404D93E4218BD.title: "Industrial Casing"
	quest.5AA5378E5E546B45.quest_desc: ["A giant asleep in snowy biomes, holding an ice crystal. Wake it and kill it; the Rude Awakening advancement goes with it."]
	quest.5AA5378E5E546B45.title: "The Frostmaw"
	quest.5ABDBFA399613C68.quest_desc: ["Flint and a stick. A knife harvests straw from grass, wheat and rice, takes ham from pigs, and is the tool most cutting board recipes ask for."]
	quest.5ABDBFA399613C68.title: "Flint Knife"
	quest.5AE7A9EC5DCA3C66.quest_desc: ["The broken Nether's war machine, at the heart of the Soul Forge."]
	quest.5AE7A9EC5DCA3C66.title: "The Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.5B3530A48FEC0381.quest_desc: ["Mined from nether quartz ore all through the netherrack. Comparators and observers take it, and Create's rose quartz is quartz and eight redstone."]
	quest.5B3530A48FEC0381.title: "Nether Quartz"
	quest.5B5EB3B40A697889.quest_desc: ["Sequenced assembly: a deployer puts a primer in each casing and a spout adds 25 mB of gunpowder fluid. It feeds the \"Stress\" Auto Pistol and the \"Crank\" SMG."]
	quest.5B5EB3B40A697889.title: "Pneumatic Pistol Ammo"
	quest.5B7BA1CAC13066F5.quest_desc: ["Summon it in the Sunken City and defeat it underwater. Bring water breathing."]
	quest.5B7BA1CAC13066F5.title: "The Leviathan"
	quest.5B8B794A1B455A31.quest_desc: ["Four blocks of redstone and four iron ingots around an eye of ender. It leads to the Ancient Factory, underground."]
	quest.5B8B794A1B455A31.title: "Eye of Mech"
	quest.5BFF747D1F3BF8BE.quest_desc: ["Engine pistons, a block of brass, a fluid tank and flint and steel: a compact source of rotation that runs on the tower's diesel or gasoline. Stop it with a redstone signal."]
	quest.5BFF747D1F3BF8BE.title: "Diesel Engine"
	quest.5C32E948EEE03D98.quest_desc: ["Sugar, a slimeball and a mundane potion in a heated basin make four. Candy cane blocks and a full set of candy cane tools come from it."]
	quest.5C32E948EEE03D98.title: "Candy Cane"
	quest.5C6F2099C2B0C35B.quest_desc: ["A nose cone, four fins, six ostrum blocks, two ostrum tanks and the ostrum engine. It reaches Venus and Mercury."]
	quest.5C6F2099C2B0C35B.title: "Tier 3 Rocket"
	quest.5CA0C8BF926F4137.quest_desc: ["Ars Elemental's lesser focuses of fire, water, earth and air are imbued from an amethyst shard, three of the element's essence and gold, and strengthen that school's spells. A Mark of Mastery, imbued from a Wilden Tribute and essences, makes a lesser focus a full one."]
	quest.5CA0C8BF926F4137.title: "Elemental Focus"
	quest.5CAA36B8331B66BF.quest_desc: ["Blaze powder, netherite scrap and soul sand around an eye of ender. It leads to the Burning Arena in the Nether Wastes."]
	quest.5CAA36B8331B66BF.title: "Eye of Flame"
	quest.5CF785860DBB1437.quest_desc: ["A brass sheet, a spout and a block of iron. Set what to print in its filter, pipe in the fluid it needs, and it copies written books or changes a package's pattern."]
	quest.5CF785860DBB1437.title: "Printer"
	quest.5D034C394DBF179E.quest_desc: ["Seven iron and a grindstone. It spins combs into honey, wax and whatever the bee gathers: a metal bee's comb gives its metal."]
	quest.5D034C394DBF179E.title: "Centrifuge"
	quest.5D2646E3EAF4F84D.quest_desc: ["Andesite alloy and copper nuggets make two. Use copper wire, sawn from copper sheets, on two connectors to run a wire between them; a connector set to pull with a wrench draws from the block it stands on."]
	quest.5D2646E3EAF4F84D.title: "Electrical Connector"
	quest.5D38DBB64406601F.quest_desc: ["Neptune's Bounty, a rare catch, holds neptunium. Its tools and armor work best in water: breathing and seeing underwater, swimming faster, and a rod that fish bite sooner."]
	quest.5D38DBB64406601F.title: "Neptunium Ingot"
	quest.5D4B88B2653139AE.quest_desc: ["Iron blocks, logs and string. Cannon balls are the standard shot; chained shot wrecks sails and grape shot crews."]
	quest.5D4B88B2653139AE.title: "Ship Cannon"
	quest.5D9C9B3B0612CDBF.quest_desc: ["Pressed from arcane ingots, or an iron sheet filled with mana by a spout."]
	quest.5D9C9B3B0612CDBF.title: "Arcane Sheets"
	quest.5DCC607997AE4285.quest_desc: ["Restore the Ruined Book with four arcane cloth, a netherite ingot, two blood vials and a bottle o' lightning to make the Ancient Codex."]
	quest.5DCC607997AE4285.title: "Ancient Codex"
	quest.5DE5F3F44D5367EF.quest_desc: ["An electron tube, a brass ingot and a dried kelp make two brass funnels, and an electron tube, two brass ingots and two dried kelp two brass tunnels. Brass ones take a filter, and a brass tunnel can share items out in turn, or send them to whichever side has room."]
	quest.5DE5F3F44D5367EF.title: "Brass Funnels and Tunnels"
	quest.5DFB616106F47811.quest_desc: ["Vexing archwood, blank parchment, an ender pearl and source gems. Performed near a creature that can be a familiar, it turns the creature into a Bound Script."]
	quest.5DFB616106F47811.title: "Ritual of Binding"
	quest.5DFBD39E0512825D.quest_desc: ["Crushed limestone, the blast furnace's flux. Crushed raw iron and limesand make molten steel, slag and furnace gas."]
	quest.5DFBD39E0512825D.title: "Limesand"
	quest.5E395A684288100D.quest_desc: ["Cocoa powder, sugar and milk in a heated basin, filled into glass bottles with a spout. It grants Regeneration."]
	quest.5E395A684288100D.title: "Hot Chocolate"
	quest.5EB171AF3BA1CCBD.quest_desc: ["Found only in ancient city chests, though Apothic Enchanting's infusion turns one into four. The rest of this chapter runs on them."]
	quest.5EB171AF3BA1CCBD.title: "Echo Shards"
	quest.5ED1A52EEDA6C9B7.quest_desc: ["Heavy plates around an engine frame (eight steel rods and a plate) and a fan (four plates and a rod)."]
	quest.5ED1A52EEDA6C9B7.title: "Steel Engine"
	quest.5EDDE2030DE9BC29.quest_desc: ["Three bamboo and two string make a blowgun, and it fires the fang's poison darts."]
	quest.5EDDE2030DE9BC29.title: "Blowgun and Darts"
	quest.5F136CC8B55C4B0F.quest_desc: ["Train track is made by sequenced assembly: a deployer puts two iron nuggets on a stone slab, and a press fixes them down. Lay it with curves and slopes by clicking from one end to the other."]
	quest.5F136CC8B55C4B0F.title: "Train Track"
	quest.5F14EA76D92060B2.quest_desc: ["Harvest grass, wheat or rice with a knife to collect straw."]
	quest.5F14EA76D92060B2.title: "Straw"
	quest.5F3D7A5915C6B7F3.quest_desc: ["Eight books and an anvil make eight. On an anvil with an enchanted item it takes half the item's enchantments as a book and destroys the item."]
	quest.5F3D7A5915C6B7F3.title: "Tome of Scrapping"
	quest.5FB1DDF87A2A35FC.quest_desc: ["Bastion chests hold this smithing template, as do When Dungeons Arise's foundries. Seven diamonds and a netherrack copy one into two."]
	quest.5FB1DDF87A2A35FC.title: "Netherite Upgrade"
	quest.5FCCE99426A7102C.quest_desc: ["A wooden slab, an andesite casing and a piston extension pole make a mechanical piston, and two planks and an andesite alloy make eight poles. The poles behind it set how far it pushes."]
	quest.5FCCE99426A7102C.title: "Mechanical Piston"
	quest.5FF5EB5DE0DF9AFF.quest_desc: ["Mechanically crafted from copper spools, capacitors, a brass casing, brass sheets, an electron tube and andesite alloy. Powered, it charges what sits below it on a depot or belt."]
	quest.5FF5EB5DE0DF9AFF.title: "Tesla Coil"
	quest.6019B70E00801379.quest_desc: ["Archwood slabs and glass. Jars store the Source that sourcelinks gather, and the chamber, the apparatus and rituals draw on jars nearby."]
	quest.6019B70E00801379.title: "Source Jar"
	quest.60733F566282395B.quest_desc: ["Nether bricks, a blaze rod, a bookshelf and a potion. A shelf of the Nether, stronger than a bookshelf."]
	quest.60733F566282395B.title: "Hellshelf"
	quest.60750D1B8480CCC2.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Witch Huts replaces the vanilla hut. Look in a swamp."]
	quest.60750D1B8480CCC2.title: "A Witch Hut"
	quest.6087A2FF321B51BF.quest_desc: ["Eight wool and an ender pearl. Stand on one and jump to go up to the next elevator above, or sneak to go down; it can be camouflaged as another block."]
	quest.6087A2FF321B51BF.title: "Elevator"
	quest.616073B5456244D7.quest_desc: ["Place an item on it, then use it with the recipe's tool in hand to break the item down: a knife for food, an axe to strip a log."]
	quest.616073B5456244D7.title: "Cutting Board"
	quest.616CA5AD6B54820E.quest_desc: ["Follow the eyes until they dive into the ground, then dig down. YUNG's Better Strongholds rebuilds it with libraries, crypts and an armoury, and somewhere inside is the portal room."]
	quest.616CA5AD6B54820E.title: "A Stronghold"
	quest.616EAC16C96FC0B2.quest_desc: ["An iron hook and four gold nuggets. Lucky: better odds of treasure. A diamond hook is the durable one, with a 50% chance not to use durability."]
	quest.616EAC16C96FC0B2.title: "Gold Hook"
	quest.6170660BBC43FE0F.quest_desc: ["Elite x Quality's guns and their ammo are made only at the Elitebench, three iron ingots and four blocks of iron. The Garand takes 32 iron and 2 planks there."]
	quest.6170660BBC43FE0F.title: "M1 Garand"
	quest.61B69BCA480AD122.quest_desc: ["Two copper sheets and a copper ingot make four fluid pipes. Pipes join up on their own as you place them, and carry fluid between anything that holds it."]
	quest.61B69BCA480AD122.title: "Fluid Pipes"
	quest.62109268132C4936.quest_desc: ["Five calorite plates around an ostrum tank and a steel rod. The rocket takes two."]
	quest.62109268132C4936.title: "Calorite Tank"
	quest.622762E96190B0B0.quest_desc: ["Both are TFMG ores: crush them, smelt the crushed ore and press the ingots into sheets. Steel mechanisms take both."]
	quest.622762E96190B0B0.title: "Lead and Nickel"
	quest.62317A2926E76B27.quest_desc: ["Two planks and a honey bottle. Catch a bee in it to carry it to a hive; sneak while releasing it to reset its hive position."]
	quest.62317A2926E76B27.title: "Bee Cage"
	quest.62816651A924C812.quest_desc: ["Set the basin on the blaze burner and a powered mechanical mixer above the basin. Drop in a copper ingot and a zinc ingot, and the heated mix makes a brass ingot."]
	quest.62816651A924C812.title: "Brass"
	quest.62A02766765D3111.quest_desc: ["Make one from copper ingots, paper and string: the first spell book. Equip it, and the spells written into it can be cast."]
	quest.62A02766765D3111.title: "Flimsy Journal"
	quest.62A51E3D268B1BC4.quest_desc: ["Fences and wood. Feed it compostable scraps and it fills with worms, the bait that makes fish bite sooner."]
	quest.62A51E3D268B1BC4.title: "Worm Farm"
	quest.62DDC33A69B7A00D.quest_desc: ["Arcane sheets, the pump, a casing and an item drain on a mechanical crafter. It draws mana out of players, spells and mobs as a fluid, and a crystalline block above a full siphon grows arcane essence."]
	quest.62DDC33A69B7A00D.title: "Mana Siphon"
	quest.63BE13D14EDE1329.quest_desc: ["Two soul crystals, two sculk bones and a second Heart of the Deep: the first went into the portal. It fires the Warden's sonic boom."]
	quest.63BE13D14EDE1329.title: "Sonorous Staff"
	quest.63CEA192232460B3.quest_desc: ["Three brass sheets, an andesite alloy, a precision mechanism and a brass casing make a mechanical arm. It picks items up from one place and puts them down in another, within reach of where it stands."]
	quest.63CEA192232460B3.title: "Mechanical Arm"
	quest.644F74B4BB9B121C.quest_desc: ["Four andesite alloy. On a heated basin it melts metal for casting: cast iron ingots, pressed from iron and coal in a heated basin, melt into molten cast iron."]
	quest.644F74B4BB9B121C.title: "Basin Foundry Lid"
	quest.64659CB5708254BD.quest_desc: ["Mine a mob spawner with Silk Touch and it drops as an item you can place again."]
	quest.64659CB5708254BD.title: "Apothic Spawners"
	quest.646C67DF694D9F01.quest_desc: ["The Wroughtnaut drops its axe and its Wrought Helm."]
	quest.646C67DF694D9F01.title: "Axe of a Thousand Metals"
	quest.6478374EE8A9E3E0.quest_desc: ["Something to shoot at that isn't a mob: five iron, redstone and a plank."]
	quest.6478374EE8A9E3E0.title: "Humanoid Target"
	quest.64C6C25FA1692890.quest_desc: ["Two fluid pipes and a glass pane on the mechanical crafters. Create Armorer's grips, magazines, sights and refits are made there too."]
	quest.64C6C25FA1692890.title: "Fluid Pipe Scope"
	quest.64E369E8743E991E.quest_desc: ["The echo template is an echo shard, deepslate and blaze powder compacted in a heated basin. At a smithing table it and an echo ingot turn a netherite chestplate into an echo one."]
	quest.64E369E8743E991E.title: "Echo Armour"
	quest.655BC8086489F3E3.quest_desc: ["Iron sheets and an iron rod. Filled at the oxygen loader and worn in its own slot, it carries extra oxygen for the suit."]
	quest.655BC8086489F3E3.title: "Oxygen Can"
	quest.65EE303CD8DB8105.quest_desc: ["Breaks affix items down into their rarity's material: common gear into Mysterious Scrap Metal, then Timeworn Fabric, Luminous Crystal Shards, Arcane Sands and Godforged Pearls as the rarity climbs."]
	quest.65EE303CD8DB8105.title: "Salvaging Table"
	quest.676B2B7878E3BCAC.quest_desc: ["Six witherite ingots, two blocks of redstone and an anvil. It fuses a boss's weapon or armor with another piece into something stronger: the Void Forge, the Immolator and the Ignitium Elytra Chestplate among them."]
	quest.676B2B7878E3BCAC.title: "Mechanical Fusion Anvil"
	quest.679B8A23F2DEA1E3.quest_desc: ["Apply a steel ingot to hardened planks for a steel casing, then a heavy plate to that. Every oil machine has one inside."]
	quest.679B8A23F2DEA1E3.title: "Heavy Machinery Casing"
	quest.67C2B4683080812F.quest_desc: ["A block of experience, pressed. The blaze enchanter writes enchantments onto blank templates, and the blaze forger applies them to items."]
	quest.67C2B4683080812F.title: "Enchanting Template"
	quest.67EFEE36E5CB83F9.quest_desc: ["Build an obsidian frame at least four blocks wide and five tall, light it with flint and steel, and step through. A block travelled in the Nether is eight in the Overworld."]
	quest.67EFEE36E5CB83F9.title: "The Nether"
	quest.680A7675FC6D91EF.quest_desc: ["Two blocks of iron and five iron ingots. It's the bit a drilling machine runs; diamond and netherite drills last longer."]
	quest.680A7675FC6D91EF.title: "Iron Drill"
	quest.681276267D02967B.quest_desc: ["The Mage's Spell Book with ender pearls, emeralds, a totem of undying, a nether star and the Chimera's Wilden Tribute. It reaches the third and last tier of glyphs."]
	quest.681276267D02967B.title: "Archmage Spell Book"
	quest.68A09A80BDA54D21.quest_desc: ["Cast two barrels, a chamber and a sliding breech, and bore each one; the breech then takes its breechblock. Most cast cannon blocks break into scrap without Silk Touch, so move a finished cannon whole."]
	quest.68A09A80BDA54D21.title: "Cast Iron Cannon"
	quest.69473B34BD76FDAB.quest_desc: ["Where bullets are made: copper, iron, gunpowder and an ammo box. The gun smith table doesn't make ammo."]
	quest.69473B34BD76FDAB.title: "TaCZ Ammo Assembly Table"
	quest.695BCB07EED54A55.quest_desc: ["Upgrades start from an upgrade base: sticks, emeralds, a honey treat and a diamond. Speed cuts the time bees spend in the hive and speeds up machines; Productivity, which takes draconic chunks, raises a hive's output and a centrifuge's rate."]
	quest.695BCB07EED54A55.title: "Speed Upgrade"
	quest.69B8EC6B3743076E.quest_desc: ["The Dominion Wand is made at the Enchanting Apparatus, a Source Relay at the crafting table. Use the wand on a jar, then on a relay, and the relay pulls Source from it; relays pass it on to other relays and jars."]
	quest.69B8EC6B3743076E.title: "Moving Source"
	quest.6A64B6AB96169AD1.quest_desc: ["The rifle's rounds: fifteen copper and three gunpowder make 45 at the Ammo Assembly Table."]
	quest.6A64B6AB96169AD1.title: "5.56x45mm Bullets"
	quest.6A821D09F9D65F31.quest_desc: ["Ars Creo's wheel: a Starbuncle Charm and a water wheel. It makes rotational force for Create, faster with a gold block in front of it."]
	quest.6A821D09F9D65F31.title: "Starbuncle Wheel"
	quest.6A867840A5B18C37.quest_desc: ["Deeper Darker adds this smithing template to ancient city chests. It turns netherite gear into warden gear."]
	quest.6A867840A5B18C37.title: "Warden Upgrade"
	quest.6A91EBF992B96D9C.quest_desc: ["Five buttons and an iron hook. Hang it on a wall and mount your best catch."]
	quest.6A91EBF992B96D9C.title: "Fish Mount"
	quest.6A9A5F0AB6429EDF.quest_desc: ["Desh plates, two etrionic capacitors and a block of diamond. It sets the gravity inside a sealed structure."]
	quest.6A9A5F0AB6429EDF.title: "Gravity Normalizer"
	quest.6AEAF22FB861C585.quest_desc: ["Iron, a rose bush and a BaBee upgrade. With two caged bees and empty cages, it breeds bees for you; which bees breed into which is in each bee's info."]
	quest.6AEAF22FB861C585.title: "Breeding Chamber"
	quest.6B44A722F756302F.quest_desc: ["A train casing and a compass make two train stations. Place one beside a track; it's where a train is assembled, and where it stops."]
	quest.6B44A722F756302F.title: "Train Station"
	quest.6C0E47B4AD488F7D.quest_desc: ["Polished rose quartz and an iron sheet make an electron tube."]
	quest.6C0E47B4AD488F7D.title: "Electron Tube"
	quest.6C1F25D584FCC12A.quest_desc: ["Soul sand or soil, bone meal, Nether roots and rotten flesh. It's the Nether's organic compost, and decays into resurgent soil for Nether crops."]
	quest.6C1F25D584FCC12A.title: "Leteos Compost"
	quest.6CB1318822EB2542.quest_desc: ["Steel ingots, heavy plates pressed from steel, and fireproof bricks make four. Placed around the furnace they let it run, and more of them make it faster."]
	quest.6CB1318822EB2542.title: "Blast Furnace Reinforcement"
	quest.6CDB55CCAB4ED5CB.quest_desc: ["Two clay balls and a nautilus shell, for the rod's bobber slot."]
	quest.6CDB55CCAB4ED5CB.title: "Bobber"
	quest.6CE71C021C3D004E.quest_desc: ["Six iron ingots and two pistons. It presses ingots into plates on energy (Ad Astra's coal generator is the simplest source), and every rocket part from here on is made of plates."]
	quest.6CE71C021C3D004E.title: "Compressor"
	quest.6CEF21A6E88DE0B4.quest_desc: ["Five addons cook in the cooking pot and cut on the board: My Nether's Delight, Ocean's Delight, Aquaculture Delight, Alex's Mobs Delight and End's Delight. Each branch here is one of them, and most need a trip somewhere for the ingredients."]
	quest.6CEF21A6E88DE0B4.title: "A Wider Menu"
	quest.6CFBFE1F970705BE.quest_desc: ["When Dungeons Arise's Foundry, in forests, jungles, plains, savannas and deserts."]
	quest.6CFBFE1F970705BE.title: "A Foundry"
	quest.6CFE2B1AE014B9CF.quest_desc: ["A brass sheet, a chute and an electron tube make a smart chute. Give it a filter and it lets only that item through."]
	quest.6CFE2B1AE014B9CF.title: "Smart Chute"
	quest.6D1264D66FCC8066.quest_desc: ["Some cities have an end ship moored beside them, with an elytra in an item frame inside and a dragon head on its bow. Jump from height to glide, and use firework rockets to climb."]
	quest.6D1264D66FCC8066.title: "Elytra"
	quest.6D6829E0422C467B.quest_desc: ["Two ignitium ingots, four blaze rods and a netherite sword. Hold right-click for three seconds to charge it, and let go to send a flame strike where you're facing."]
	quest.6D6829E0422C467B.title: "The Incinerator"
	quest.6E1F568EE28426C1.quest_desc: ["It unlocks the catacombs' vaults."]
	quest.6E1F568EE28426C1.title: "Bone Key"
	quest.6E3D0D2EA1E2CA79.quest_desc: ["The cutting board, automated: right-click it with a knife or another valid tool, and it cuts items below it, in a basin too. Create: Central Kitchen also lets a deployer holding a knife cut on a cutting board, and a mechanical saw cut ingredients."]
	quest.6E3D0D2EA1E2CA79.title: "Slicer"
	quest.6E69A8B32CAE0154.quest_desc: ["Fireclay is mined like clay. Smelt its balls into fireproof bricks, and four bricks make a block. The steelworks is built of them."]
	quest.6E69A8B32CAE0154.title: "Fireproof Bricks"
	quest.6E998CBF6EC851AB.quest_desc: ["Four fans, a large gas tank, an oxygen loader and desh plates. It fills a sealed room with air at a livable temperature: how a base on the Moon breathes."]
	quest.6E998CBF6EC851AB.title: "Oxygen Distributor"
	quest.6EBE4E7B0CD98ED3.quest_desc: ["Follow the compass down into the catacombs."]
	quest.6EBE4E7B0CD98ED3.title: "The Catacombs"
	quest.6ED955A757045B19.quest_desc: ["A precision mechanism is built up on a golden sheet by sequenced assembly: a deployer adds a cogwheel, a large cogwheel and an iron nugget, five times over. Four times in five it comes out a mechanism; otherwise it gives back a part, such as a cogwheel or a golden sheet."]
	quest.6ED955A757045B19.title: "Precision Mechanism"
	quest.6EDFD65CE85B2DEF.quest_desc: ["Coal goes in from any side, and coal coke drops out after a while. Carbon dioxide comes out of the top and creosote from the other sides."]
	quest.6EDFD65CE85B2DEF.title: "Coal Coke"
	quest.6EED6889E0466CF9.quest_desc: ["A seashelf infused at a table with at least 45 eterna, 15 quanta and 10 arcana."]
	quest.6EED6889E0466CF9.title: "Infused Seashelf"
	quest.6F16E7B4BD7E8FD8.quest_desc: ["A sturdy sheet and paper make four train schedules. Write in where to go and when to leave, then give it to the train's conductor and the train drives itself."]
	quest.6F16E7B4BD7E8FD8.title: "Train Schedule"
	quest.6F7969F9EBB25C6A.quest_desc: ["A shaft, an andesite casing and a block of iron make a mechanical press. It presses ingots into sheets."]
	quest.6F7969F9EBB25C6A.title: "Mechanical Press"
	quest.7005D32BEDEA332C.quest_desc: ["A golden sheet, an andesite alloy and a block of copper make a steam engine. Put it on the side of a fluid tank with blaze burners under the tank and water pumped in, and the tank becomes a boiler; the engine turns a shaft in front of it. More tanks, more heat and more engines make more power."]
	quest.7005D32BEDEA332C.title: "Steam Engine"
	quest.7072A92CCC02FE94.quest_desc: ["In the Nether, behind a magical ward; an Enchanted Ward Amulet protects you against it."]
	quest.7072A92CCC02FE94.title: "The Lost Citadel"
	quest.708DE29A1933F201.quest_desc: ["Source gems, gold ingots and a lava bucket. It burns fuel for Source, more for archwood logs, and fills the jars around it. The other sourcelinks feed on crop growth, food, mob deaths or potions."]
	quest.708DE29A1933F201.title: "Volcanic Sourcelink"
	quest.70ED7703EED1BB0F.quest_desc: ["A card in a node's face says what it does there: extract, insert, stock or sense, on a channel, with a filter."]
	quest.70ED7703EED1BB0F.title: "Item Card"
	quest.7106786BEB894002.quest_desc: ["Eight blaze rods and a nether brick. Its heat runs from embers to a live flame, white-hot and blazing, and it cooks to match: smoking, campfire cooking, smelting and baking."]
	quest.7106786BEB894002.title: "Blazier"
	quest.7155F0E7ACD975E8.quest_desc: ["Build a ship at the dockyard: a cog, brigg, caravel, dhow, drakkar, galleon or galley, in any wood. Tick this once you've launched one."]
	quest.7155F0E7ACD975E8.title: "A Ship"
	quest.7170F64CBB68B2BD.quest_desc: [
		"Affix items are gear with a coloured name and extra stats, rolled by rarity, from mobs and chests. Your first one unlocks Haven, the world tier you start in. Press Ctrl+T to pick a tier once you've unlocked more."
		"With Modern Ragnarok, guns roll affixes too."
	]
	quest.7170F64CBB68B2BD.title: "World Tier: Haven"
	quest.72439FD2BE61D913.quest_desc: ["Voids what goes into it, with a filter for up to nine items. Fluid and energy trash cans do the same for those."]
	quest.72439FD2BE61D913.title: "Item Trash Can"
	quest.7359F1AE9E2B0712.quest_desc: ["The catacombs' master. Defeat him, and he leaves a Bone Key for each player who fought him."]
	quest.7359F1AE9E2B0712.title: "The Dead King"
	quest.73E001A7DEEAC194.quest_desc: ["Four iron ingots, a block of cardboard and two redstone dust make a packager. It boxes the contents of the inventory behind it into packages, each addressed to where it should go."]
	quest.73E001A7DEEAC194.title: "Packager"
	quest.73FA39500FA10D30.quest_desc: ["The mechanical press makes copper sheets from copper ingots. Pipes and tanks are made of them."]
	quest.73FA39500FA10D30.title: "Copper Sheets"
	quest.7452C74AF111A5CA.quest_desc: ["Ostrum plates, blue ice and a large gas tank. It turns ice into cryo fuel, three times as efficient as rocket fuel."]
	quest.7452C74AF111A5CA.title: "Cryo Freezer"
	quest.74D431E29A0341A9.quest_desc: ["A shaft, an andesite casing and a propeller make an encased fan. The propeller is four iron sheets around an andesite alloy. Items the fan blows through water are washed, through lava smelted, and through fire smoked."]
	quest.74D431E29A0341A9.title: "Encased Fan"
	quest.74D5C9F3EA02990E.quest_desc: ["Puts the layers of a built-up cannon together; pulse it with power to grab or let go. Blasting the finished layers with a fan into lava turns them into built-up cannon blocks, stronger than cast ones."]
	quest.74D5C9F3EA02990E.title: "Cannon Builder"
	quest.74F0FEDB7C5FDA76.quest_desc: ["Iron nuggets around a block of redstone make two. Place them around the coil: the stronger the magnets, the more of the rotation becomes electricity, and the more stress the coil takes."]
	quest.74F0FEDB7C5FDA76.title: "Redstone Magnet"
	quest.74F9258858BC6EC1.quest_desc: ["Installed at the dockyard: cotton sails for speed, copper plating for maneuverability and iron scantlings for durability."]
	quest.74F9258858BC6EC1.title: "Ship Upgrades"
	quest.750A1A964F418DF1.quest_desc: ["Make one from chains, leather and paper: a sturdier book with room for more spells."]
	quest.750A1A964F418DF1.title: "Ironbound Tome"
	quest.751CEC361333C578.quest_desc: ["A spout fills andesite alloy with 50 mB of gunpowder fluid. Mix gunpowder in a basin for the fluid; nitropowder fluid makes primer too. Every round takes one."]
	quest.751CEC361333C578.title: "Primer"
	quest.75505BBEF534CCCC.quest_desc: ["A Naga's drop: eight darts with a stick, or a Naga Fang Dagger."]
	quest.75505BBEF534CCCC.title: "Naga Fang"
	quest.75C52F7F20D35941.quest_desc: ["Two iron, two string and a stick. Aquaculture's rods hold a hook, bait, a fishing line and a bobber, and each one changes how the rod fishes."]
	quest.75C52F7F20D35941.title: "Iron Fishing Rod"
	quest.75DCDBE0EEA2031A.quest_desc: ["The blueprint and three of one material at a crafting table. Almost anything counts, from iron to Silent Gems' gems and TFMG's aluminum, and each material gives the head its own stats and traits."]
	quest.75DCDBE0EEA2031A.title: "Pickaxe Head"
	quest.7634101950E16F0B.quest_desc: ["A copper casing, a dried kelp block and a copper sheet make a hose pulley. It lowers a hose into a lake or a pool of lava and drains it, or fills one; a big enough body of water never runs out."]
	quest.7634101950E16F0B.title: "Hose Pulley"
	quest.76C1818AB31349DC.quest_desc: ["A brass casing, a dried kelp block and an iron sheet make an elevator pulley. It lifts a contraption between floors, stopping at each elevator contact it passes, like a lift."]
	quest.76C1818AB31349DC.title: "Elevator Pulley"
	quest.76D956DABC6F3D3F.quest_desc: ["Four leather, four string and a chest. Place it to open it as a chest, or wear it and open it with a key."]
	quest.76D956DABC6F3D3F.title: "Backpack"
	quest.76F6310F407E471C.quest_desc: ["Four andesite alloy, two iron sheets and an andesite casing make a mechanical harvester, and three iron sheets, three andesite alloy and an andesite casing a mechanical plough. Moving over a field, one reaps ripe crops and replants them, and the other tills the ground."]
	quest.76F6310F407E471C.title: "Harvester and Plough"
	quest.7720B04895F075F0.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Desert Temples replaces the vanilla pyramid with a temple of traps and puzzles. Look in a desert."]
	quest.7720B04895F075F0.title: "A Desert Temple"
	quest.7771507DB80B111D.quest_desc: ["With the dragon dead, a gateway opens at the island's edge; throw an ender pearl into it to reach the outer islands. Purpur towers stand there, guarded by shulkers."]
	quest.7771507DB80B111D.title: "An End City"
	quest.77BC20BC33378845.quest_desc: ["A blaze burner assembled with a shriving stone, an arcane ingot, an arcane rune and mana. Give it a scroll and superheat it, and it casts the scroll's spell on its own, paying in mana."]
	quest.77BC20BC33378845.title: "Blaze Caster"
	quest.77C919C0D8A0972C.quest_desc: ["Four andesite casings and a large cogwheel make two chain conveyors. Link them with chains and the chains carry rotation, and packages, between them over any distance."]
	quest.77C919C0D8A0972C.title: "Chain Conveyor"
	quest.780CAE0E4D843A83.quest_desc: ["The mechanical crafters make a potato cannon from fluid pipes, copper, an andesite alloy and a precision mechanism. It fires crops, and a few of them do more than bounce."]
	quest.780CAE0E4D843A83.title: "Potato Cannon"
	quest.7892FC3D7C0849DD.quest_desc: ["The guardian of the Ruined Citadel."]
	quest.7892FC3D7C0849DD.title: "The Ender Guardian"
	quest.78C74461D601B49E.quest_desc: ["Wear a full set of rare gear and kill the Wither, which is summoned in the Nether chapter."]
	quest.78C74461D601B49E.title: "World Tier: Summit"
	quest.78CD2CEEFD9D500F.quest_desc: ["The simple table rebuilt with netherite, Arcane Sands and nether bricks. It reforges epic and mythic gear as well, fuelled by Sigils of Rebirth."]
	quest.78CD2CEEFD9D500F.title: "Reforging Table"
	quest.7927E97C4E8FFA6E.quest_desc: ["Iron nuggets, a magnetite block, an andesite casing and a shaft; magnetite is mined. A motor turns electricity into rotation: set its speed with a wrench, and a redstone signal stops it."]
	quest.7927E97C4E8FFA6E.title: "Basic Motor"
	quest.795E2270536A9542.quest_desc: ["Eight planks and a honeycomb. Placed on an advanced beehive, it makes the hive bigger."]
	quest.795E2270536A9542.title: "Expansion Box"
	quest.797E46E3D3BC28A1.quest_desc: ["Reactor casing is bricks and an iron sheet energised, deployed and pressed. Reactor rods hold the reaction, the fuel acceptor takes fuel, and the heat vent sends heat into heat pipes. Encase it all in reactor casing or glass against radiation, and give the heat somewhere to go, or it melts down."]
	quest.797E46E3D3BC28A1.title: "Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.799FFB79754D33F8.quest_desc: ["An eye of ender, an amethyst shard, redstone ore and sticks. Use it to find the ore veins under the ground near you; the Ore Vein Atlas keeps track of the ones you've found."]
	quest.799FFB79754D33F8.title: "Ore Vein Finder"
	quest.79AB7049D387D3BF.quest_desc: ["A Ring of Potential (iron nuggets and a source gem) with diamonds, ender pearls and source gems at the apparatus. It adds a little mana and regeneration, and makes every spell cheaper to cast."]
	quest.79AB7049D387D3BF.title: "Ring of Lesser Discount"
	quest.79C16CA564983056.quest_desc: ["Shows the chunks around it in a 5 by 5 grid; the ones with an oil deposit glow. Dig down where it points."]
	quest.79C16CA564983056.title: "Surface Scanner"
	quest.79DFF370FD992E55.quest_desc: ["A zinc sheet, a copper sheet and a redstone torch. Most electric machines take one or two."]
	quest.79DFF370FD992E55.title: "Capacitor"
	quest.79E2DACAF78DB921.quest_desc: ["An advanced energiser with overcharged diamonds, diamonds and copper. Energise diamonds first."]
	quest.79E2DACAF78DB921.title: "Reinforced Energiser"
	quest.7A08E657D5CA98F7.quest_desc: ["Four iron nuggets. Durable: a 20% chance for the rod not to use durability. Every other hook starts from one."]
	quest.7A08E657D5CA98F7.title: "Iron Hook"
	quest.7A3A4183959CDCA9.quest_desc: ["Joins the chests and barrels touching it into one multiblock, so you can deposit into all of them, and pipe to and from them, through the controller."]
	quest.7A3A4183959CDCA9.title: "Storage Controller"
	quest.7A4B53E9A5219118.quest_desc: ["The Frostmaw drops it, or you can steal it from a sleeping one (Big Brain™ Time). Hold it to breathe frost."]
	quest.7A4B53E9A5219118.title: "Ice Crystal"
	quest.7AA8B342AA4E93C7.quest_desc: ["A brass sheet, a fluid pipe and an electron tube make a smart fluid pipe. Give it a filter and only that fluid passes."]
	quest.7AA8B342AA4E93C7.title: "Smart Fluid Pipe"
	quest.7B41B0F759B19F94.quest_desc: ["The Citadel's boss. Defeat him for a Decrepit Key for each player who fought him."]
	quest.7B41B0F759B19F94.title: "Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer"
	quest.7B6041B3674F60B0.quest_desc: ["Summon Maledictus in the Frosted Prison and defeat it."]
	quest.7B6041B3674F60B0.title: "Maledictus"
	quest.7BC441E3A756D832.quest_desc: ["The Umvuthana's leader, at the heart of the grove."]
	quest.7BC441E3A756D832.title: "Umvuthi, the Sunbird"
	quest.7BCEF8F5B514BAB1.quest_desc: ["A cogwheel and a fluid pipe make a mechanical pump. Turned, it pushes fluid through the pipes it sits in, in the direction it faces; reverse the rotation to pull the other way."]
	quest.7BCEF8F5B514BAB1.title: "Mechanical Pump"
	quest.7C4CDB9926801D3F.quest_desc: ["The M1911's rounds: ten copper and two gunpowder make 30 at the Ammo Assembly Table."]
	quest.7C4CDB9926801D3F.title: ".45 ACP Bullets"
	quest.7C6AC7DC1AE63700.quest_desc: ["Assemble a train at a station, hand its conductor a schedule, and watch it run the route on its own."]
	quest.7C6AC7DC1AE63700.quest_subtitle: "Tick this once a train runs its schedule"
	quest.7C6AC7DC1AE63700.title: "All Aboard"
	quest.7C6BD54FBD8CED44.quest_desc: ["Six heavy plates make four, which is what a rocket takes."]
	quest.7C6BD54FBD8CED44.title: "Rocket Fins"
	quest.7C9E0FB4D14D144E.quest_desc: ["A brass casing, a chute and a copper spool. It charges or drains a moving contraption that stops beside it."]
	quest.7C9E0FB4D14D144E.title: "Portable Energy Interface"
	quest.7CE486B704B55818.quest_desc: ["A machine of an ancient civilization, asleep in the Ancient Factory. Wake it, and defeat it."]
	quest.7CE486B704B55818.title: "The Harbinger"
	quest.7D5679FCDA22F007.quest_desc: ["A warp stone, andesite casing, stone bricks and ender pearls make two. Activate one and you can teleport to it from any other; villages often have one already."]
	quest.7D5679FCDA22F007.title: "Waystone"
	quest.7D74F1B14F9AE7C4.quest_desc: ["Fallout's guns have no bench of their own: they're made at the gun smith table. The 10mm Pistol takes 14 iron, 4 iron nuggets and 2 leather, and its 10mm rounds come from the Ammo Assembly Table."]
	quest.7D74F1B14F9AE7C4.title: "10mm Pistol"
	quest.7D7AF1F19903D0DF.quest_desc: ["Andesite alloy is what most of Create is made of. Two andesite and two iron nuggets make one on a crafting table, and zinc nuggets work in place of the iron."]
	quest.7D7AF1F19903D0DF.title: "Andesite Alloy"
	quest.7DC27D945DE68ECA.quest_desc: ["A smooth stone slab and a chest. Put several flowering blocks in it to give your bees one flowering spot."]
	quest.7DC27D945DE68ECA.title: "Feeding Slab"
	quest.7DEAB55B3B9AAC5C.quest_desc: ["Strip a log with an axe, then use andesite alloy on it, by hand or with a deployer, to make andesite casing. The mechanical press, the mixer and the deployer are all built around one."]
	quest.7DEAB55B3B9AAC5C.title: "Andesite Casing"
	quest.7E29C2D7F06EBDD2.quest_desc: ["Four iron sheets around a block of netherrack make an empty blaze burner."]
	quest.7E29C2D7F06EBDD2.title: "Empty Blaze Burner"
	quest.7E8D002E58D5A9FF.quest_desc: ["A wooden slab, an andesite casing and a cogwheel make a gantry carriage, and two andesite alloy and a redstone dust make eight gantry shafts. The carriage rides along a turning shaft, carrying its contraption with it."]
	quest.7E8D002E58D5A9FF.title: "Gantry"
	quest.7ECB07A077FF51C9.quest_desc: ["Runs on steam from water and fuel, with a steam engine inside. Create Jetpack's jetpack, from a copper backtank and an elytra, is the other one in the pack."]
	quest.7ECB07A077FF51C9.title: "Brass Jetpack"
	quest.7EE307D28A5AD7D0.quest_desc: ["Lava buckets, netherite scrap and blackstone around an eye of ender. It leads to the Soul Forge, in the Nether."]
	quest.7EE307D28A5AD7D0.title: "Eye of Monstrous"
	quest.7EF51364E83D93C2.quest_desc: ["Arcane sheets and an arcane ingot make four. Mana leaks quickly out of any pipe that isn't insulated with arcane material, so mana goes through these."]
	quest.7EF51364E83D93C2.title: "Arcane Pipes"
	quest.7F0DA09A21E7476B.quest_desc: ["Open a chest in a structure. Lootr gives every player their own loot from each chest, barrel and cart, so nobody takes it all before you get there."]
	quest.7F0DA09A21E7476B.title: "'X' Marks the Spot"
	quest.7F1F8499DE5CFD3B.quest_desc: ["It appears on the exit portal after the first kill only. Touching it teleports it away, so push it with a piston or drop it onto a torch to pick it up."]
	quest.7F1F8499DE5CFD3B.title: "Dragon Egg"
	quest.7F3E71ED98A6A670.quest_desc: ["YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments rebuilds the monument, guardians and elder guardians included. Bring water breathing."]
	quest.7F3E71ED98A6A670.title: "An Ocean Monument"
	quest.7FC823D7C99801FE.quest_desc: ["Iron, a chest and a block of iron. It holds a rod with its hooks, bait, lines and bobbers."]
	quest.7FC823D7C99801FE.title: "Tackle Box"
	quest.7FF6115E1818DE66.quest_desc: ["Makes Silent Gear's metal alloys for less than the crafting table: three crimson steel from a block of crimson iron, two blaze rods and a magma cream. Crimson steel, azure electrum, crushed shulker shell and netherite scrap make tyrian steel, its strongest metal, only here."]
	quest.7FF6115E1818DE66.title: "Alloy Forge"
}
